The second step was power.

31
00:02:33,790 --> 00:02:38,030
The third and final step for you to
master... is this!

32
00:02:39,830 --> 00:02:40,830
What

33
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,900
do you mean by this already?!

34
00:03:04,425 --> 00:03:08,100
It looks like I'm simply holding an
ordinary balloon, doesn't it?

35
00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:09,840
What do you mean, looks like?

36
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:12,640
That is all you're doing, you pervy
weirdo!

37
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,800
Huh.

38
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,960
Let me try again.

39
00:03:15,259 --> 00:03:16,939
Let's see what's over on my left this
time.

40
00:03:19,065 --> 00:03:21,940
Let's see what's really happening inside
the balloon.

41
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:27,100
Whoa!

42
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:30,620
The chakra is spinning wildly and getting
faster!

43
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:33,040
But it's still perfectly round!

44
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:36,300
It's almost like...
Take a look at that!

45
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,900
Like a small typhoon!

46
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:42,560
So then, what you're doing in your left
hand...

47
00:03:42,561 --> 00:03:45,200
is also happening in the balloon on your
right?

48
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:46,080
That's right!

49
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:47,300
What do you think?

50
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:48,420
Nifty, huh?

51
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,260
Awesome!

52
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:56,860
He's got all of that chakra whizzing
around... and the balloon isn't even moving!

53
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:03,240
There's more power than when the rubber
ball popped... and way more spin to it!

54
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,640
Now listen.

55
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:09,220
In the third step, you've got to draw up
100% of what you've learned so far...

56
00:04:09,221 --> 00:04:11,120
and then maintain it.

57
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:18,500
In other words, keeping the power and the
rotation of your chakra at their maximum.

58
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:22,340
First, visualize a thin membrane just
inside the balloon.

59
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:25,640
Then, of compressing the chakra inside it.

60
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:29,840
Wow!

61
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:35,180
So this stage is about keeping up the
power and rotation that I learned...

62
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:38,360
only this time without letting him pop
open a delicate balloon!

63
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:41,540
Well, you're starting to get the hang of
this!

64
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,720
Good!

65
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,580
So wait, hold on a second.

66
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:48,840
Why exactly am I going to all this
trouble?

67
00:04:50,975 --> 00:04:51,975
Come here.

68
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:53,345
I'll show you.

69
00:04:54,575 --> 00:04:55,640
Watch closely.

70
00:04:56,435 --> 00:04:59,080
After the first two steps of training,
you get this.

71
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:07,100
Then,

72
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:15,420
once you've mastered
the third step... ...

73
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:23,720
...you get this!

74
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:34,520
... ... ... ... ...

75
00:05:42,865 --> 00:05:45,432
If you can keep that small
typhoon the size of your

76
00:05:45,433 --> 00:05:48,060
palm, then the energy
will be unable to disperse.

77
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:53,281
It'll spin faster and faster, and its power
will become more and more compressed.

78
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:57,660
And its destructive power will reach its
max.

79
00:06:00,135 --> 00:06:02,800
So, there you have it.

80
00:06:07,350 --> 00:06:08,350
Right!

81
00:06:08,570 --> 00:06:10,150
This'll be no sweat!

82
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:29,300
This feels right!

83
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,120
Keep it going!

84
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,120
Keep it going!

85
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,540
Keep it going!

86
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,540
Keep it going!

87
00:06:56,530 --> 00:06:58,150
There's no cutting corners here.

88
00:06:58,330 --> 00:07:02,350
Get your power and rotation to a hundred
percent, and then maintain them.

89
00:07:02,351 --> 00:07:04,050
This is crazy!

90
00:07:04,950 --> 00:07:09,030
Unless I can perfectly control
my power... ...it's impossible!

91
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,150
I see now.

92
00:07:14,490 --> 00:07:19,830
This third step... ...it's on a whole
other level compared to the first two!

93
00:07:20,490 --> 00:07:21,770
I told you, didn't I?

94
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,490
This is an A-rank technique.

95
00:07:24,125 --> 00:07:26,050
It's a highly advanced ninjutsu,
kid.

96
00:07:28,570 --> 00:07:31,030
Okay, that's enough explaining for today.

97
00:07:31,031 --> 00:07:33,210
You can practice on the road.

98
00:07:35,030 --> 00:07:36,510
Hey, hold on a minute!

99
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:38,940
Do we have to rush?

100
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,130
Give me a chance to...

101
00:07:40,131 --> 00:07:43,510
We've already wasted enough time waiting
for you to recover your strength.

102
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:48,930
There's no guarantee that Tsunade will
stay in this town much longer.

103
00:07:49,690 --> 00:07:50,210
Why?

104
00:07:50,450 --> 00:07:52,030
Uh, yeah, but... but...

105
00:07:52,031 --> 00:07:55,093
It's not like she's gonna bump
into some old acquaintance

106
00:07:55,094 --> 00:07:57,310
and start reminiscing
over the good old days.

107
00:07:58,020 --> 00:07:59,630
Come on, let's go!

108
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:02,110
Alright...

109
00:08:39,950 --> 00:08:43,490
It's been quite a long time, hasn't it,
Orochimaru?

110
00:08:44,930 --> 00:08:45,250
Indeed.

111
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:47,490
I've been looking for you everywhere.

112
00:08:48,110 --> 00:08:50,670
What do you want with me after all this
time?

113
00:08:50,671 --> 00:08:53,730
You feel like kicking around stories of
the old days?

114
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:59,130
Actually, I was hoping to ask you for a
favor.

115
00:09:00,145 --> 00:09:04,390
His heartbeat is racing, and he's burning
up by the look of him.

116
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,010
Definitely signs of prolonged fatigue.

117
00:09:07,490 --> 00:09:09,710
And those arms...

118
00:09:11,830 --> 00:09:16,270
Lady Tsunade, I'm sure you've surmised by
now.

119
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,430
Find someone else.

120
00:09:18,431 --> 00:09:21,070
I haven't treated anyone in years.

121
00:09:21,450 --> 00:09:22,730
That won't do.

122
00:09:23,575 --> 00:09:26,810
Surely you must realize how serious these
wounds are.

123
00:09:26,930 --> 00:09:29,770
There isn't anyone who can cure him of his
affliction.

124
00:09:31,170 --> 00:09:36,770
Except, of course, for the legendary
Sannin and medical genius Lady Tsunade.

125
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:39,110
Only you can do this.

126
00:09:43,250 --> 00:09:47,130
Those arms of yours... that's no ordinary
injury.

127
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:53,230
A special sealing jutsu or something.

128
00:09:53,710 --> 00:09:55,670
What have you gotten yourself into?

129
00:09:56,570 --> 00:09:57,850
Nothing, really.

130
00:09:58,670 --> 00:10:01,130
I was just killing the third Hokage.

131
00:10:04,010 --> 00:10:05,010
Impossible!

132
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:07,050
Is this true?

133
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:10,570
Oh, come now, Tsunade.

134
00:10:10,690 --> 00:10:12,550
Quit shooting me that dirty look.

135
00:10:12,930 --> 00:10:16,210
Anything that has form must one day decay.

136
00:10:16,710 --> 00:10:18,190
Even men.

137
00:10:18,191 --> 00:10:22,670
But I don't really need to tell you that
now, do I?

138
00:10:27,470 --> 00:10:34,010
After all, you let the two most dear to
you march off to their deaths.

139
00:10:38,229 --> 00:10:39,229
Such a pity.

140
00:10:40,364 --> 00:10:43,010
It really was a terrible way for them to
die.

141
00:10:43,370 --> 00:10:44,370
Scum!

142
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:49,190
I'm sorry.

143
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:54,340
Needles.

144
00:10:55,034 --> 00:10:56,034
Dipped in poison.

145
00:10:57,420 --> 00:10:58,540
She's fast.

146
00:10:58,900 --> 00:11:00,080
Get out of my way!

147
00:11:02,500 --> 00:11:03,800
Shizune, calm down!

148
00:11:11,054 --> 00:11:13,760
This assistant... she's powerful.

149
00:11:13,761 --> 00:11:14,761
She's powerful.

150
00:11:25,860 --> 00:11:26,860
Orochimaru.

151
00:11:27,259 --> 00:11:30,160
You were always this twisted, even when we
were kids.

152
00:11:33,059 --> 00:11:35,420
Come on, you know the type of gal I am.

153
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,280
Don't even kid with me, okay?

154
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,620
Or shall I kill you where you stand?

155
00:11:57,660 --> 00:11:59,820
Or shall I kill you where you stand?

156
00:11:59,821 --> 00:11:59,980
Wait.

157
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:02,040
We're here to negotiate.

158
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,600
I've told you once already.

159
00:12:04,860 --> 00:12:06,340
Now get the hell out of my sight!

160
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:09,720
You're the only one who can cure Lord
Orochimaru's arms.

161
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,800
You know that!

162
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:12,060
I'm warning you.

163
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:14,480
We're not asking for charity.

164
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:16,260
We can make a deal here.

165
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:18,080
I'll count down from five.

166
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:20,820
I suggest you leave before I'm done.

167
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:27,740
Otherwise, I'll have to make
you... Please, try to remain calm.

168
00:12:27,741 --> 00:12:30,660
This could prove beneficial for both of
us.

169
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:32,020
Five.

170
00:12:33,260 --> 00:12:34,260
Four.

171
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,480
Three.

172
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,280
Two.

173
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:45,460
And one.

174
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:52,540
I'm offering to bring your dear little
brother and your beloved back to life...

175
00:12:52,541 --> 00:12:56,460
with a forbidden jutsu that I have
developed.

176
00:13:14,209 --> 00:13:18,220
I can't help but notice that you haven't
chased us off yet, my old friend.

177
00:13:19,929 --> 00:13:23,520
I suppose it's safe to assume we have a
deal here, then.

178
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,560
Come now.

179
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:32,060
Don't you want to see them again,
dear Tsunade?

180
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,600
What do you plan on doing...

181
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:44,400
once your arms have been restored to you?

182
00:13:48,900 --> 00:13:50,340
Well, you know me.

183
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:52,040
I've never been one to lie.

184
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,640
So I'll just give you the truth.

185
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,840
How about that?

186
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:02,300
In addition to grabbing all I desire...

187
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:08,340
this time around... I'm going to
grind the Hidden Leaf Village into dust.

188
00:14:13,739 --> 00:14:14,739
Well, what do you say?

189
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:20,399
Don't trust them!

190
00:14:20,584 --> 00:14:22,300
Do not listen to their sweet words!

191
00:14:23,179 --> 00:14:24,760
Think of your brother and my uncle!

192
00:14:25,479 --> 00:14:27,320
They wouldn't have wanted any part of
this!

193
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,240
Don't decide now.

194
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:40,140
But we'll expect your answer within the
week.

195
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:47,680
Keep in mind... if your answer is yes...
this jutsu requires two human sacrifices.

196
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:48,960
I'm going to give you the answer.

197
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:51,400
It will be your job to take care of that
part.

198
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:53,020
What are we doing?

199
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,500
I say we kill them both!

200
00:14:54,980 --> 00:14:55,980
Here and now!

201
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,200
Come on, Lady Tsunade!

202
00:14:57,220 --> 00:14:58,120
What are we waiting for?

203
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,420
Together we can...

204
00:15:06,430 --> 00:15:07,430
Lady Tsunade...

205
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:42,890
It's true I may be a little weak right
now.

206
00:15:43,810 --> 00:15:44,810
However...

207
00:15:46,490 --> 00:15:50,550
Our good friend here has her own
weaknesses too, doesn't she?

208
00:15:51,250 --> 00:15:52,390
So he knows.

209
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:58,050
I see you haven't lost it yet,
have you?

210
00:15:58,630 --> 00:16:01,690
Your fear of blood...

211
00:16:04,870 --> 00:16:05,870
Haemophobia...

212
00:16:08,770 --> 00:16:09,410
Come.

213
00:16:09,710 --> 00:16:12,070
It's time we were going, Kabuto.

214
00:16:13,110 --> 00:16:16,130
I look forward to your decision,
Tsunade.

215
00:16:16,770 --> 00:16:19,430
I'm sure it will be the right one.

216
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,880
So what happened?

217
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:42,680
It's like a typhoon hit it.

218
00:16:43,505 --> 00:16:44,960
Yeah... Run!

219
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,480
Run for your life!

220
00:16:46,860 --> 00:16:47,860
Hey, you there!

221
00:16:48,460 --> 00:16:49,560
What's going on?

222
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:51,720
Tell me, what are you running from?

223
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,340
If you're smart, you'll run too!

224
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:55,140
There's a monster up there!

225
00:16:56,339 --> 00:16:57,339
A monster?

226
00:16:57,749 --> 00:16:58,920
Now just calm down.

227
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:00,460
What kind of monster?

228
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,160
What do you mean?

229
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:01,740
A snake!

230
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:02,780
A huge snake!

231
00:17:02,781 --> 00:17:05,020
It crushed the castle without even trying!

232
00:17:06,769 --> 00:17:08,000
Well, I'm outta here!

233
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,880
Wait, how big a snake?

234
00:17:10,274 --> 00:17:12,160
Hey, our village was attacked by one too!

235
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,359
Wait, don't go!

236
00:17:13,579 --> 00:17:15,400
I know something about big snakes!

237
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:17,000
Naruto, come on!

238
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:17,540
Huh?

239
00:17:17,889 --> 00:17:19,780
This could be the same snake.

240
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,880
I'd like a closer look at this monster.

241
00:17:30,829 --> 00:17:32,420
Looks like we're too late.

242
00:17:34,049 --> 00:17:35,820
Did the snake do this too?

243
00:17:36,179 --> 00:17:37,179
Let's go, Naruto.

244
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:37,860
Huh?

245
00:17:38,249 --> 00:17:39,900
We're not gonna find Tsunade here.

246
00:17:40,190 --> 00:17:40,860
Not again!

247
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:42,900
I was hoping he'd forgotten about her!

248
00:17:44,094 --> 00:17:45,860
This is getting ridiculous!

249
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:48,960
How many places are you gonna drag me to?

250
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:52,400
I'm starting to think this old lady
doesn't even exist!

251
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:54,840
Hmm...

252
00:17:55,574 --> 00:17:58,980
Well, in the meantime, we'll get a bite to
eat in here.

253
00:17:59,320 --> 00:17:59,520
Hmm?

254
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:00,620
Hey!

255
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:01,940
What are you talking about?

256
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,120
It's a tavern!

257
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:03,860
Yeah?

258
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:05,180
So what?

259
00:18:05,719 --> 00:18:07,660
You trying to be a bad influence on me?

260
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,440
Hello?

261
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:09,560
I'm underage!

262
00:18:09,939 --> 00:18:10,640
You idiot.

263
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:13,120
Nobody is making you do anything,
alright?

264
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:16,040
Just have a snack and stay out of the
grown-ups' way.

265
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:20,220
If we're just looking to eat, why don't we
go somewhere real, like a ramen shop?

266
00:18:20,569 --> 00:18:21,840
Why this stinky dump?

267
00:18:22,110 --> 00:18:23,110
When will you learn?

268
00:18:23,529 --> 00:18:26,200
This is just the sort of place where you
can pick up information.

269
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:34,170
Hmm?

270
00:18:34,770 --> 00:18:35,130
Huh?

271
00:18:35,131 --> 00:18:36,131
Huh?

272
00:18:37,270 --> 00:18:38,270
Tsunade!

273
00:18:38,330 --> 00:18:39,330
Huh?

274
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:40,550
Jiraiya?

275
00:18:40,850 --> 00:18:41,850
What the?

276
00:18:41,949 --> 00:18:42,949
Why are you here?

277
00:18:43,530 --> 00:18:45,930
Finally, I've been looking everywhere for
you.

278
00:18:46,269 --> 00:18:47,970
Oh, should've known you'd be in here.

279
00:18:48,685 --> 00:18:50,590
That... is Tsunade?

280
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:58,100
An old lady, right, pervy sage.

281
00:18:58,740 --> 00:19:00,140
I should've known.

282
00:19:04,429 --> 00:19:05,700
I can't believe it.

283
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:08,720
To have met two of the other Sanin in the
same day.

284
00:19:18,049 --> 00:19:23,510
Oh, for the past

285
00:19:28,979 --> 00:19:30,105
three years, Tsunade and Saru have been
best friends?

286
00:19:30,129 --> 00:19:33,390
You know, Tsunade is the one who's been
here the most recently.

287
00:19:33,391 --> 00:19:33,990
Right.

288
00:19:34,370 --> 00:19:34,870
That's it.

289
00:19:34,871 --> 00:19:36,210
It's all over.

290
00:19:36,211 --> 00:19:37,451
Well, then what's done is done.

291
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,040
But I'm afraid...

292
00:19:41,041 --> 00:19:44,280
You know, once we come here, we'll be
condemned and not be able to say anything.

293
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:02,880
You still have a long way to go.

294
00:20:02,881 --> 00:20:03,000
I want to hear more from you, then.

295
00:20:03,001 --> 00:20:03,320
A healer?

296
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:06,260
Or did he make that part up too?

297
00:20:08,495 --> 00:20:11,840
Well then, why have you been looking for
me?

298
00:20:16,129 --> 00:20:17,430
I'll cut right to the chase.

299
00:20:23,654 --> 00:20:26,371
Tsunade, in its wisdom,
the village has come to

300
00:20:26,372 --> 00:20:29,291
the decision to name
you as the fifth Hokage.

301
00:20:39,679 --> 00:20:41,520
Hey, can we get some service around here?

302
00:20:41,869 --> 00:20:43,240
Alright, alright, coming!

303
00:20:47,909 --> 00:20:49,060
Fifth Hokage?

304
00:20:50,234 --> 00:20:51,600
Where did that come from?

305
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:53,680
What the heck's going on here?

306
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:59,440
You heard about the third Hokage.

307
00:21:01,589 --> 00:21:02,589
The third Hokage.

308
00:21:03,809 --> 00:21:04,809
So it's true.

309
00:21:10,965 --> 00:21:13,540
It was Orochimaru's doing, right?

310
00:21:13,939 --> 00:21:15,300
I heard about it.

311
00:21:15,819 --> 00:21:17,000
In fact, he told me.

312
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:20,220
Orochimaru's doing?

313
00:21:21,629 --> 00:21:22,629
Hold on a second!

314
00:21:22,949 --> 00:21:24,960
You're saying he's the one who killed the
old man?

315
00:21:25,559 --> 00:21:27,080
Who is this Orochimaru guy?

316
00:21:27,824 --> 00:21:31,580
He's one of the Sanin like Tsunade here,
and yours truly.

317
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:33,300
But then why?

318
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,060
The Sanin are all from the Leaf Village,
right?

319
00:21:36,180 --> 00:21:37,240
Why'd he do it?

320
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:39,280
Who's this brat you've got with you?

321
00:21:42,580 --> 00:21:45,120
This is Naruto Uzumaki.

322
00:21:47,300 --> 00:21:48,800
Okay, wait a second!

323
00:21:49,380 --> 00:21:50,880
I haven't finished yet!

324
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:52,820
There's something about this I'm not
getting!

325
00:21:53,639 --> 00:21:56,760
So this guy, you know he's the one who
murdered the Hokage!

326
00:21:57,499 --> 00:21:58,920
What have you done about it?

327
00:22:00,639 --> 00:22:01,420
He's a Sanin!

328
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:02,460
He's one of you guys!

329
00:22:03,079 --> 00:22:04,279
Why's he still walking around?

330
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:05,540
Why haven't you caught him?

331
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:10,440
And oh yeah, what's the deal about her
being the fifth Hokage?

332
00:22:10,660 --> 00:22:13,000
Naruto, sit down and shut up.

333
00:22:13,219 --> 00:22:14,340
Absolutely not!

334
00:22:14,341 --> 00:22:15,960
Sit down!

335
00:22:28,980 --> 00:22:29,980
Impossible.

336
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,160
I decline.

337
00:22:34,609 --> 00:22:36,280
You know, it's kind of funny.

338
00:22:36,530 --> 00:22:37,530
That rings a bell.

339
00:22:38,869 --> 00:22:43,360
I remember you saying those very words the
first and only time I ever asked you out.

340
00:22:45,169 --> 00:22:46,920
Wouldn't somebody tell me what's going on?

341
00:22:47,120 --> 00:22:48,840
What the heck are we doing here?

342
00:22:48,841 --> 00:22:50,807
You said we were gonna
bring her back to the

343
00:22:50,808 --> 00:22:53,121
village to cure Sasuke
and Kakashi-sensei!

344
00:22:54,079 --> 00:22:56,300
Then you pull this stuff about making her
Hokage?

345
00:22:56,580 --> 00:22:58,600
Then she goes and refuses it!

346
00:23:01,560 --> 00:23:05,460
No, she couldn't really be thinking of
accepting Orochimaru's offer.

347
00:23:10,120 --> 00:23:11,260
Don't worry, Naruto.

348
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:13,020
She knows she can't refuse.

349
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:15,200
There can be no one else.

350
00:23:16,099 --> 00:23:20,900
There was no one who contributed more to
the Leafs' victory in the Great War.

351
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:30,200
She combines unrivaled skills as a warrior
with the ability to heal others.

352
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:35,120
What's more, she is the granddaughter of
the very first Hokage.

353
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:38,382
So in heritage and
abilities, she is the

354
00:23:38,383 --> 00:23:41,760
clear and only choice
to be the fifth Hokage.

355
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:46,040
And once she accepts her
destiny... which she will...

356
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:51,140
then she'll have to come back with us to
the village, and there heal your friends.

357
00:23:52,059 --> 00:23:54,783
You see, it's all been
very carefully thought

358
00:23:54,784 --> 00:23:57,040
out by the highest
councils of the village.

359
00:23:57,660 --> 00:24:02,360
No offense, but it's not something an
underage genin is expected to understand.

360
00:24:05,539 --> 00:24:06,700
You're slipping, Jiraiya.

361
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:09,400
This apprentice isn't at all like your
last one.

362
00:24:09,649 --> 00:24:10,649
He's a fool.

363
00:24:11,179 --> 00:24:12,179
With a big mouth.

364
00:24:12,280 --> 00:24:13,200
Funny-looking, too.

365
00:24:13,201 --> 00:24:14,201
Oh, yeah!

366
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:18,140
Well, to be fair, it'd be hard for anyone
to measure up to that standard.

367
00:24:19,079 --> 00:24:24,121
The fourth Hokage showed all the signs of
becoming the greatest ninja in generations.

368
00:24:24,180 --> 00:24:26,720
Brimming with talent and natural ability.

369
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:27,560
Brilliant.

370
00:24:27,600 --> 00:24:28,160
Popular.

371
00:24:28,569 --> 00:24:31,360
And to top it off, nearly as handsome as
his teacher.

372
00:24:32,399 --> 00:24:35,060
Oh, sure, but all that didn't save him
from dying young.

373
00:24:36,699 --> 00:24:39,440
Throwing his life away, all for the sake
of the village?

374
00:24:44,580 --> 00:24:45,820
Money's one thing.

375
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,260
A life's another.

376
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:52,580
To risk your life against all the odds?

377
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,420
That's a sucker's bet.

378
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:01,420
A sucker's bet?!

379
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:04,220
My grandfather and his successor?

380
00:25:04,600 --> 00:25:07,860
They were all so willing to die to defend
the village.

381
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:10,500
Well, they're both dead, all right.

382
00:25:10,800 --> 00:25:13,180
And the village is no safer than it ever
was.

383
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:14,656
The village is no safer than it ever was.

384
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:16,320
The village is no safer than it ever was.

385
00:25:17,620 --> 00:25:20,040
Sounds to me you've changed, Tsunade.

386
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:25,761
I don't know what's happened to make you
like this, but to say such things out loud?

387
00:25:27,700 --> 00:25:29,900
Don't forget I'm not as young as I look.

388
00:25:30,260 --> 00:25:32,580
The years have taught me a great deal.

389
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:41,520
Sarutobi Sensei, too.

390
00:25:42,060 --> 00:25:43,580
He should have known better.

391
00:25:43,581 --> 00:25:47,340
What did he expect, trying to be a hero at
his age?

392
00:26:09,389 --> 00:26:10,389
Playing at Hokage?

393
00:26:11,189 --> 00:26:12,750
Count me out, it's a fool's game.

394
00:26:13,139 --> 00:26:16,530
Let me go!

395
00:26:16,890 --> 00:26:17,690
Stop it!

396
00:26:17,710 --> 00:26:18,030
Let me out!

397
00:26:18,031 --> 00:26:18,550
That's enough.

398
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:19,750
People are looking.

399
00:26:20,110 --> 00:26:21,370
Get off me!

400
00:26:21,390 --> 00:26:22,670
Man, let me go!

401
00:26:22,671 --> 00:26:24,290
Lady Tsunade...

402
00:26:25,730 --> 00:26:28,730
I'm not gonna let her sit there and make
fun of the old man!

403
00:26:29,050 --> 00:26:29,630
No way!

404
00:26:29,910 --> 00:26:31,690
I don't care if she is a lady!

405
00:26:32,864 --> 00:26:35,450
I'll knock that cynical sneer off her
face!

406
00:26:36,594 --> 00:26:38,310
Are you challenging me?

407
00:26:38,959 --> 00:26:40,470
You've got guts if nothing else.

408
00:26:41,189 --> 00:26:42,770
Let's take this outside, kid.

409
00:26:43,030 --> 00:26:44,030
No, no!

410
00:26:52,670 --> 00:26:56,150
One of the legendary Sanin taking on a
snotty-nosed Genin?

411
00:26:57,835 --> 00:27:00,050
I ought to be ashamed of myself.

412
00:27:00,630 --> 00:27:02,570
Who you calling snotty?

413
00:27:07,739 --> 00:27:09,470
Oh, stop trying to show off.

414
00:27:09,810 --> 00:27:10,990
You see this?

415
00:27:11,694 --> 00:27:12,694
One finger.

416
00:27:13,709 --> 00:27:15,850
It's all I'm gonna need to take you down.

417
00:27:16,210 --> 00:27:17,790
Please, don't!

418
00:27:17,870 --> 00:27:18,870
Well?

419
00:27:19,390 --> 00:27:21,310
What are you waiting for, kid?

420
00:27:21,311 --> 00:27:24,650
Don't ever underestimate me!

421
00:27:36,764 --> 00:27:39,490
Lady Tsunade!

422
00:27:42,454 --> 00:27:45,560
A flick to the forehead?

423
00:27:46,999 --> 00:27:47,999
I'll show her!

424
00:27:51,604 --> 00:27:53,380
Whoa, she's good.

425
00:27:55,140 --> 00:27:56,280
Hey, kid!

426
00:27:58,149 --> 00:28:00,100
One question before you pass out.

427
00:28:02,909 --> 00:28:06,840
Tell me, what makes you so touchy about
Hokage?

428
00:28:12,969 --> 00:28:15,210
It's because unlike you, that's my goal!

429
00:28:15,810 --> 00:28:16,890
Just watch!

430
00:28:17,110 --> 00:28:18,750
Someday I'll be Hokage!

431
00:28:21,249 --> 00:28:22,370
Remember this!

432
00:28:24,150 --> 00:28:25,470
To be Hokage!

433
00:28:25,710 --> 00:28:27,030
That is my dream!

434
00:28:32,300 --> 00:28:33,420
That boy...

435
00:28:37,240 --> 00:28:38,900
She let her guard down!

436
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,980
There's no way I can take her head on!

437
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:44,420
Now's the time to use that jutsu!

438
00:28:45,080 --> 00:28:46,080
Focus!

439
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:47,600
Stay!

440
00:28:48,700 --> 00:28:49,260
Stop!

441
00:28:49,340 --> 00:28:50,340
Stay!

442
00:28:51,220 --> 00:28:51,960
Stop!

443
00:28:52,100 --> 00:28:53,100
Stay!

444
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:54,700
Stop!

445
00:28:54,940 --> 00:28:55,940
Stay!

446
00:28:56,620 --> 00:28:57,360
Stop!

447
00:28:57,620 --> 00:28:57,860
Stay!

448
00:28:57,860 --> 00:28:57,860
Stop!

449
00:28:57,861 --> 00:28:58,861
Stay!

450
00:28:59,420 --> 00:29:00,160
Wait!

451
00:29:00,161 --> 00:29:02,320
That jutsu is...

452
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,140
AHHHHHHHHHHH!!!

453
00:29:05,141 --> 00:29:05,840
Stop!

454
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,920
Stay!

455
00:29:16,870 --> 00:29:17,610
Unbelievable.

456
00:29:17,611 --> 00:29:20,990
I never expected the fourth Hokage's
jutsu.

457
00:29:21,919 --> 00:29:24,030
Still, it's not like the real thing.

458
00:29:28,450 --> 00:29:28,930
Hmm.

459
00:29:28,931 --> 00:29:30,730
Tsunade's as strong as ever, I see.

460
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:35,098
I remember the time she
gave me a shot that sent me

461
00:29:35,099 --> 00:29:37,531
flying a hundred meters
in the opposite direction.

462
00:29:38,050 --> 00:29:39,050
Ouch.

463
00:29:40,274 --> 00:29:42,810
He shouldn't even try to take her on.

464
00:29:44,509 --> 00:29:45,830
Naruto, are you alright?

465
00:29:46,874 --> 00:29:50,730
Jiraiya, are you the one who taught this
little kid the Rasengan?

466
00:29:51,990 --> 00:29:52,470
Rasengan?

467
00:29:52,910 --> 00:29:54,690
Well, of course I did.

468
00:29:54,770 --> 00:29:55,970
I'm his teacher, aren't I?

469
00:29:56,499 --> 00:29:57,530
What of it?

470
00:29:57,970 --> 00:29:58,970
Huh.

471
00:29:59,029 --> 00:30:02,310
You and the fourth Hokage are the only
ones who can use that jutsu.

472
00:30:03,019 --> 00:30:06,670
What's the point of teaching it to someone
who can never master it, you old fool?

473
00:30:08,689 --> 00:30:10,210
Giving him false hopes like that.

474
00:30:10,899 --> 00:30:12,570
Filling his head with stupid ideas.

475
00:30:13,249 --> 00:30:15,810
Making him think he could actually be
Hokage someday.

476
00:30:16,764 --> 00:30:18,330
I'll show you who's stupid!

477
00:30:18,719 --> 00:30:19,410
Just wait!

478
00:30:19,620 --> 00:30:20,350
Just wait!

479
00:30:20,590 --> 00:30:23,510
Give me just three days and I'll
have the... That jutsu down flat!

480
00:30:25,929 --> 00:30:26,950
Watch what you say, kid.

481
00:30:27,729 --> 00:30:29,370
I might just hold you to it.

482
00:30:29,849 --> 00:30:33,090
I said it and I never go back on my word!

483
00:30:34,230 --> 00:30:36,350
That's my Nindo, my ninja way!

484
00:30:39,350 --> 00:30:44,510
Well then, care to make a bet on it?

485
00:30:45,610 --> 00:30:46,610
A bet?

486
00:30:47,250 --> 00:30:48,630
I'll give you one week.

487
00:30:49,299 --> 00:30:52,270
If you can master that jutsu by then,
I'll admit I'm wrong.

488
00:30:52,271 --> 00:30:54,230
And that you're worthy of becoming Hokage.

489
00:30:54,879 --> 00:30:56,210
I'll even throw in my necklace.

490
00:30:56,550 --> 00:30:57,810
Lady Tsunade, no!

491
00:30:58,050 --> 00:30:59,670
No, you don't really mean that!

492
00:30:59,990 --> 00:31:01,210
Ah, you can keep it.

493
00:31:01,250 --> 00:31:02,570
I'm not really into jewelry.

494
00:31:02,870 --> 00:31:03,870
You numbskull.

495
00:31:04,510 --> 00:31:07,270
That necklace belonged to the first Hokage
himself.

496
00:31:07,710 --> 00:31:09,570
There are only two like it in the world.

497
00:31:09,870 --> 00:31:13,670
Why, that little thing is worth three gold
mines and the mountains on top of them.

498
00:31:14,010 --> 00:31:15,010
Ah!

499
00:31:16,670 --> 00:31:18,890
Lady, you've got yourself a bet.

500
00:31:19,330 --> 00:31:21,410
It's always money with this kid.

501
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:23,510
All right.

502
00:31:23,690 --> 00:31:28,230
However, if you don't master it in a week,
you lose and admit I was right.

503
00:31:28,410 --> 00:31:30,650
And I get the money in froggy.

504
00:31:31,030 --> 00:31:31,410
Ah!

505
00:31:31,550 --> 00:31:32,330
Not karma!

506
00:31:32,490 --> 00:31:33,490
Wait a second!

507
00:31:33,630 --> 00:31:35,890
Lady Tsunade, what are you doing?

508
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:37,730
How could you gamble with the necklace?

509
00:31:38,210 --> 00:31:39,990
He hasn't a chance of winning.

510
00:31:40,390 --> 00:31:41,450
Let's go, Shizune.

511
00:31:41,810 --> 00:31:45,350
No matter how bad things got, she's never
bet the necklace before.

512
00:31:49,380 --> 00:31:50,560
Don't decide now.

513
00:31:50,561 --> 00:31:54,000
But we'll expect your answer within the
week.

514
00:32:03,840 --> 00:32:04,400
Welcome!

515
00:32:04,860 --> 00:32:05,860
Come in!

516
00:32:05,999 --> 00:32:07,340
Funny finding you here.

517
00:32:08,659 --> 00:32:09,780
What the hell do you want?

518
00:32:10,389 --> 00:32:11,389
Don't be that way.

519
00:32:12,234 --> 00:32:13,560
You know you're glad to see me.

520
00:32:13,764 --> 00:32:15,800
Master Jiraiya.

521
00:32:16,954 --> 00:32:20,400
Shizune, would you mind leaving the two of
us alone for a while?

522
00:32:21,219 --> 00:32:23,120
It's been years since we've sat down
together.

523
00:32:24,909 --> 00:32:27,440
Bring me the house special over here,
and a drink.

524
00:32:27,669 --> 00:32:28,420
Yes, sir.

525
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:29,480
Coming up.

526
00:32:31,984 --> 00:32:34,380
Thank you, Master Jiraiya.

527
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,240
Here you go.

528
00:32:41,220 --> 00:32:42,340
Ah, perfect.

529
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,480
Just the thing.

530
00:32:46,840 --> 00:32:48,905
I have to say, I never
imagined that you'd

531
00:32:48,906 --> 00:32:52,421
still have that necklace
after all these years.

532
00:32:52,554 --> 00:32:55,820
I just assumed you would have gambled it
away long before now.

533
00:32:57,120 --> 00:32:59,640
Guess it's all you have to remember them
by.

534
00:33:07,040 --> 00:33:08,560
Is he on your mind?

535
00:33:08,940 --> 00:33:09,940
What do you mean?

536
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,680
Naruto, of course.

537
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:15,960
Not much.

538
00:33:17,260 --> 00:33:18,040
I don't know.

539
00:33:18,220 --> 00:33:21,360
Taking on a young kid like that as an
opponent...

540
00:33:21,361 --> 00:33:25,620
He'll never be able to master that jutsu
in a week, and you know it.

541
00:33:26,349 --> 00:33:27,480
It's not much of a bet.

542
00:33:30,140 --> 00:33:31,800
Why so glum, anyway?

543
00:33:33,339 --> 00:33:34,040
Who's glum?

544
00:33:34,344 --> 00:33:35,904
I don't know what you're talking about.

545
00:33:37,500 --> 00:33:39,920
When are you meeting Orochimaru again?

546
00:33:41,229 --> 00:33:43,640
I can see it in Shizune's face.

547
00:33:44,429 --> 00:33:46,881
I don't know what sort of
deal he may have offered

548
00:33:46,882 --> 00:33:49,581
you, but think carefully
before accepting it.

549
00:33:49,709 --> 00:33:50,820
Very carefully.

550
00:33:51,655 --> 00:33:54,125
Remember the Hokage
that have come before, and

551
00:33:54,126 --> 00:33:57,481
all they've accomplished
for the Leaf Village.

552
00:33:57,869 --> 00:34:00,028
It's only thanks to
them that the village has

553
00:34:00,029 --> 00:34:02,761
survived, even prospered,
through troubled times.

554
00:34:03,289 --> 00:34:08,701
This was their dream, and they were all
willing to gamble everything to achieve it.

555
00:34:08,950 --> 00:34:09,960
Even their lives.

556
00:34:11,620 --> 00:34:14,940
Betray that dream and you make all their
sacrifices meaningless.

557
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:17,480
Why am I saying this?

558
00:34:17,639 --> 00:34:19,159
Could you do such a thing?

559
00:34:22,940 --> 00:34:26,659
If I thought you could, I would stop you
right here and now.

560
00:34:28,739 --> 00:34:31,060
It has nothing to do with me anymore.

561
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:34,615
A person who feels
nothing at the death of those

562
00:34:34,616 --> 00:34:37,861
close to him is no
different than a butcher.

563
00:34:39,265 --> 00:34:40,300
But you're not like that.

564
00:34:40,900 --> 00:34:45,380
There was no one who cared more for the
village or felt its pain more deeply.

565
00:34:47,300 --> 00:34:50,300
I remember the day... Okay,
that's enough with the lecture!

566
00:34:53,540 --> 00:34:54,540
That dumb kid.

567
00:34:55,730 --> 00:34:57,240
Why did you have to bring him here?

568
00:34:57,241 --> 00:35:00,120
To be Hokage, that is my dream!

569
00:35:02,640 --> 00:35:03,640
They're a lot alike.

570
00:35:04,790 --> 00:35:06,540
They must be almost the same age.

571
00:35:08,140 --> 00:35:09,220
It's not just that.

572
00:35:14,620 --> 00:35:17,980
To be Hokage, that is my dream!

573
00:35:21,310 --> 00:35:22,580
You're always so reckless.

574
00:35:22,990 --> 00:35:24,030
You want to kill yourself?

575
00:35:24,530 --> 00:35:26,484
You're still just a
genin, so if there's ever

576
00:35:26,485 --> 00:35:28,480
a real battle, you
get out of there fast!

577
00:35:28,481 --> 00:35:29,940
Are you crazy?

578
00:35:30,300 --> 00:35:31,320
I'm never gonna run away!

579
00:35:33,050 --> 00:35:34,680
They're more alike than you know.

580
00:35:39,560 --> 00:35:42,620
What the... who could that be at this time
of night?

581
00:35:43,370 --> 00:35:45,240
Okay, okay, I'm coming already!

582
00:35:46,134 --> 00:35:47,134
Hold your...

583
00:35:49,090 --> 00:35:50,260
I know it's awfully late.

584
00:35:51,010 --> 00:35:52,760
I'm sorry, but I must talk to you.

585
00:35:53,980 --> 00:35:55,952
I want to get a good
night's sleep, cause I'm

586
00:35:55,953 --> 00:35:57,860
gonna start training
first thing in the morning!

587
00:35:57,861 --> 00:35:58,861
That's just it.

588
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:02,921
Before you get into this, there's something
you must know about the necklace.

589
00:36:03,790 --> 00:36:05,700
And also, about Lady Tsunade.

590
00:36:25,780 --> 00:36:27,720
Noaki, I can't believe you're twelve.

591
00:36:28,169 --> 00:36:29,169
Happy birthday.

592
00:36:30,980 --> 00:36:33,860
Just because you're my sister,
you don't have to give me presents.

593
00:36:33,940 --> 00:36:35,800
I'm not a little kid anymore, you know
that?

594
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:36,440
Oh yeah?

595
00:36:36,780 --> 00:36:39,020
You're still a kid as far as I'm
concerned.

596
00:36:39,424 --> 00:36:42,300
Anyway, whether you are or not,
go on and open it.

597
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:44,460
I think you're definitely gonna like it.

598
00:36:51,640 --> 00:36:53,820
Sister, is this what I think it is?

599
00:36:54,280 --> 00:36:54,760
Yep.

600
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,640
It belonged to our grandfather.

601
00:36:56,720 --> 00:36:58,840
The necklace of the first Hokage.

602
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:00,440
I love you!

603
00:37:01,820 --> 00:37:04,340
I thought it made more sense for you to
have it.

604
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:08,120
I know you've had your eye on it for a
long time now.

605
00:37:08,620 --> 00:37:10,060
Take good care of it.

606
00:37:10,340 --> 00:37:11,200
Oh, I will!

607
00:37:11,300 --> 00:37:12,340
And not just the necklace!

608
00:37:13,460 --> 00:37:16,000
This entire village meant a lot to our
grandfather.

609
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:19,400
And I'm gonna take good care of all of it!

610
00:37:20,660 --> 00:37:21,180
Noaki...

611
00:37:21,181 --> 00:37:26,601
After all, I'm the grandson of the Hokage
who built the village hidden in the leaves!

612
00:37:26,660 --> 00:37:30,660
Remember, like you always say,
a man never goes back on his word.

613
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:31,040
Right!

614
00:37:31,240 --> 00:37:36,141
And I give my word I'll follow our
grandfather's footsteps and be just like him!

615
00:37:36,980 --> 00:37:40,440
To be Hokage... that's my dream!

616
00:37:43,380 --> 00:37:45,900
Noaki, take off your headband,
just for a sec.

617
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:46,500
Huh?

618
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,320
Go on, take it off.

619
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:50,440
I have one more present I want to give
you.

620
00:37:52,460 --> 00:37:55,520
A magic charm to make your dream come
true.

621
00:38:21,900 --> 00:38:24,300
No, it's best if you don't look,
Tsunade.

622
00:38:24,580 --> 00:38:27,740
What difference can it make?

623
00:38:28,220 --> 00:38:30,260
The condition the body's in...

624
00:38:30,261 --> 00:38:33,340
She won't even be able to recognize her
little brother.

625
00:38:33,341 --> 00:38:34,341
Silence, Orochimaru!

626
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:37,060
This is what happens in war.

627
00:38:37,900 --> 00:38:40,540
Shinobi are just left on the battlefield
to die.

628
00:38:41,240 --> 00:38:44,360
There are no doctors or healers to help
them.

629
00:38:44,700 --> 00:38:46,840
It's too bad the boy was so reckless.

630
00:38:46,841 --> 00:38:49,660
As if he thought he were invulnerable.

631
00:38:50,340 --> 00:38:53,920
And the day after receiving such a lovely
gift, too.

632
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,120
Oh, I will!

633
00:39:05,220 --> 00:39:06,260
And not just the necklace!

634
00:39:09,140 --> 00:39:11,740
This entire village meant a lot to our
grandfather.

635
00:39:12,340 --> 00:39:14,560
And I'm gonna take good care of all of it!

636
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,547
Therefore, I'm making
this proposal for any

637
00:39:19,548 --> 00:39:22,541
four ninja squad that
we send into harm's way.

638
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:27,020
If we make one member of each squad a
trained medical specialist, it will not

639
00:39:27,021 --> 00:39:29,354
only increase their survival
rate, but will improve

640
00:39:29,355 --> 00:39:31,340
the chances of their
mission being a success.

641
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:35,402
I say we need to establish
a teaching facility to train

642
00:39:35,403 --> 00:39:38,800
selected ninja in the healing
arts, and we need to do it now!

643
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:40,240
At once!

644
00:39:40,340 --> 00:39:41,960
We've lost too many shinobi already!

645
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:47,240
Ah... yes, there is much sense in what you
say, Tsunade.

646
00:39:47,460 --> 00:39:51,440
But at present, we have no one with enough
expertise in such things.

647
00:39:51,441 --> 00:39:53,440
And we're in the midst of a great war.

648
00:39:53,740 --> 00:39:56,986
Such an undertaking would
require time and resources,

649
00:39:56,987 --> 00:39:59,841
and our enemies won't
sit back and wait for us.

650
00:40:00,560 --> 00:40:02,000
So we do nothing?

651
00:40:02,860 --> 00:40:05,400
We go on throwing their lives away?

652
00:40:05,680 --> 00:40:06,320
I agree.

653
00:40:06,580 --> 00:40:07,780
I say she's right.

654
00:40:08,120 --> 00:40:12,840
If we can learn to save future generations
of shinobi, then those who've died...

655
00:40:12,841 --> 00:40:15,280
perhaps this way their deaths will have
meaning.

656
00:40:18,460 --> 00:40:19,020
Wait!

657
00:40:19,021 --> 00:40:20,021
Wait!

658
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:21,960
Thanks for that.

659
00:40:24,040 --> 00:40:25,180
There's no need to thank me.

660
00:40:25,240 --> 00:40:26,380
What you said was right.

661
00:40:28,410 --> 00:40:31,260
I was thinking... it's getting late.

662
00:40:31,810 --> 00:40:33,180
Would you like me to see you home?

663
00:40:33,480 --> 00:40:36,960
Oh, but don't you... isn't
your house... Mm-hmm.

664
00:40:37,200 --> 00:40:38,200
The other way.

665
00:40:39,160 --> 00:40:40,160
Don't bother, really.

666
00:40:40,790 --> 00:40:41,800
Oh, it's no bother.

667
00:40:42,700 --> 00:40:43,980
I wanted to talk to you anyway.

668
00:40:45,450 --> 00:40:47,720
Besides, I love this walk and all its
memories.

669
00:40:47,721 --> 00:40:51,360
It's the way I used to go to pick my
little sister up at the academy.

670
00:40:52,520 --> 00:40:53,520
Used to?

671
00:40:54,300 --> 00:40:55,300
Yes.

672
00:40:55,650 --> 00:40:59,260
That night a year ago, when the village
was attacked, my sister was killed.

673
00:41:01,695 --> 00:41:02,695
So him too.

674
00:41:03,260 --> 00:41:04,280
We're the same.

675
00:41:11,535 --> 00:41:13,960
Tomorrow's another mission into enemy
territory.

676
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:19,640
Who ever said it was a shinobi's duty to
watch his comrades die one by one?

677
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,400
I know.

678
00:41:22,100 --> 00:41:23,640
We're beset by death.

679
00:41:23,980 --> 00:41:25,260
It's all around us.

680
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:29,740
I'd give my life to bring some order to
this war-torn world.

681
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:34,220
I love this village and the people in it
with all my heart.

682
00:41:34,520 --> 00:41:36,500
I want to protect them.

683
00:41:37,500 --> 00:41:40,600
I want to lead them in building a better
world than this.

684
00:41:41,330 --> 00:41:43,700
It's been my dream ever since my sister
died.

685
00:41:45,500 --> 00:41:47,220
It's all that's kept me going.

686
00:41:49,220 --> 00:41:50,640
To be Hokage.

687
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:51,880
That is my dream.

688
00:42:00,430 --> 00:42:01,430
Don.

689
00:42:07,109 --> 00:42:08,109
Take this.

690
00:42:08,890 --> 00:42:09,890
I want you to have it.

691
00:42:16,530 --> 00:42:17,410
Hang on, Don.

692
00:42:17,530 --> 00:42:18,530
You'll be alright.

693
00:42:20,110 --> 00:42:20,590
Tsunade.

694
00:42:20,591 --> 00:42:23,090
I don't want to die yet.

695
00:42:24,290 --> 00:42:28,730
There are so many things left to do.

696
00:42:29,650 --> 00:42:30,770
Don't try to talk!

697
00:42:31,650 --> 00:42:33,010
He's all torn up inside.

698
00:42:33,710 --> 00:42:35,250
No one can help him now.

699
00:42:35,330 --> 00:42:36,810
Not even one of the Sanin.

700
00:42:37,790 --> 00:42:39,010
It can't be.

701
00:42:39,510 --> 00:42:40,810
I can't die here.

702
00:42:41,550 --> 00:42:42,550
Not this way.

703
00:42:43,010 --> 00:42:44,010
Not yet.

704
00:42:44,490 --> 00:42:45,490
Don't worry, Don.

705
00:42:45,550 --> 00:42:46,750
I've stopped the bleeding.

706
00:42:47,970 --> 00:42:49,390
Just save your strength.

707
00:42:49,890 --> 00:42:51,170
You're going to be alright.

708
00:42:52,090 --> 00:42:53,490
Well, thank goodness.

709
00:42:55,430 --> 00:42:56,510
So can you.

710
00:42:57,930 --> 00:42:58,930
Don't.

711
00:43:09,920 --> 00:43:10,920
Don't go!

712
00:43:11,320 --> 00:43:12,440
Please, don't go!

713
00:43:12,700 --> 00:43:13,780
Don't leave me!

714
00:43:14,040 --> 00:43:15,040
Don't.

715
00:43:15,120 --> 00:43:15,860
Don't go!

716
00:43:16,040 --> 00:43:16,560
Don't.

717
00:43:16,940 --> 00:43:17,460
Don't!

718
00:43:17,700 --> 00:43:17,700
Don't go!

719
00:43:17,740 --> 00:43:18,340
Don't go!

720
00:43:18,580 --> 00:43:19,580
Don't go!

721
00:43:19,620 --> 00:43:20,200
Don't go!

722
00:43:20,420 --> 00:43:20,560
Stop there!

723
00:43:20,780 --> 00:43:21,700
It's not over!

724
00:43:21,701 --> 00:43:22,701
He's dead!

725
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:29,320
Egret

726
00:43:34,120 --> 00:43:40,520
Moonshine Noooo!!!

727
00:44:14,890 --> 00:44:16,110
There's no way!

728
00:44:16,330 --> 00:44:17,990
I'm totally out of gas!

729
00:44:18,270 --> 00:44:20,050
Just gotta try it again tomorrow!

730
00:44:22,190 --> 00:44:23,610
Ugh, my head!

731
00:44:24,510 --> 00:44:25,510
What a night!

732
00:44:25,760 --> 00:44:28,990
Ugh, that Tsunade always was a bad
influence.

733
00:44:30,790 --> 00:44:31,790
Huh?

734
00:44:34,690 --> 00:44:36,100
Naruto never came in.

735
00:44:36,810 --> 00:44:38,320
Must have been training all night.

736
00:44:39,225 --> 00:44:40,580
Hmph, little fool.

737
00:45:03,790 --> 00:45:05,830
So, do we have a deal?

738
00:45:06,970 --> 00:45:11,117
I'm offering to bring your dear
little brother and your beloved

739
00:45:11,118 --> 00:45:15,390
back to life with a forbidden
jutsu that I have developed.

740
00:45:16,730 --> 00:45:21,210
Come now, don't you want to see them
again, dear Tsunade?

741
00:45:25,930 --> 00:45:30,770
What do you plan on doing once your arms
have been restored to you?

742
00:45:31,050 --> 00:45:35,670
This time around, I'm going to grind the
Hidden Leaf Village into dust.

743
00:45:35,790 --> 00:45:37,410
My lady, think of your brother!

744
00:45:37,510 --> 00:45:38,550
Think of my uncle!

745
00:45:38,990 --> 00:45:40,910
It would be a betrayal of them!

746
00:45:41,090 --> 00:45:42,350
A betrayal of yourself!

747
00:45:42,950 --> 00:45:44,770
Have you forgotten all your dreams?

748
00:45:44,930 --> 00:45:45,930
I'll cut to the chase.

749
00:45:47,030 --> 00:45:50,720
Tsunade, in all its wisdom,
the village has come

750
00:45:50,721 --> 00:45:53,891
to the decision to name
you as the fifth Hokage.

751
00:46:20,030 --> 00:46:21,030
Now listen.

752
00:46:21,170 --> 00:46:22,590
In the third step, you've got to...

753
00:46:22,610 --> 00:46:27,510
Now draw up 100% of what you've learned so
far, and then maintain it.

754
00:46:42,810 --> 00:46:48,030
In other words, keeping the power and the
rotation of your chakra at their maximum.

755
00:46:48,850 --> 00:46:49,950
I get it.

756
00:46:50,250 --> 00:46:51,970
I can see it in my head.

757
00:46:52,670 --> 00:46:55,211
But no matter how
hard I try, I just can't

758
00:46:55,212 --> 00:46:59,031
focus all my chakra
into a neat little ball.

759
00:47:20,210 --> 00:47:23,510
What's the point of teaching it to someone
who can never master it?

760
00:47:23,610 --> 00:47:25,450
Giving him false hopes like that?

761
00:47:25,770 --> 00:47:27,850
Filling his head with stupid ideas?

762
00:47:28,390 --> 00:47:31,250
Making him think he could actually be
Hokage someday?

763
00:47:37,090 --> 00:47:38,090
Aaaaaah!

764
00:47:39,650 --> 00:47:40,650
Aaaaaah!

765
00:47:41,550 --> 00:47:42,110
Aaaaaah!

766
00:47:42,530 --> 00:47:43,690
Come on!

767
00:47:47,750 --> 00:47:50,070
Okay, once again, here we go.

768
00:47:51,410 --> 00:47:52,950
I'll nail it this time.

769
00:48:16,370 --> 00:48:17,370
Tomorrow, then.

770
00:48:21,294 --> 00:48:22,710
Come back soon, okay?

771
00:48:23,030 --> 00:48:24,370
Well, how about right now?

772
00:48:25,210 --> 00:48:26,690
I'm just playing with it.

773
00:48:26,790 --> 00:48:27,930
You take care now.

774
00:48:39,950 --> 00:48:42,930
When are you meeting Orochimaru again?

775
00:48:50,870 --> 00:48:52,650
The look of guilt on her face.

776
00:48:52,810 --> 00:48:55,230
Things could be even worse than I
suspected.

777
00:48:58,040 --> 00:48:59,770
One week, she said.

778
00:48:59,970 --> 00:49:01,190
That worries me.

779
00:49:08,250 --> 00:49:10,690
And it's been nearly a week since Naruto
slept.

780
00:49:10,870 --> 00:49:15,210
I think I better have another little talk
with Tsunade.

781
00:49:28,870 --> 00:49:30,170
It's no use.

782
00:49:33,170 --> 00:49:35,110
Why can't I do it?

783
00:49:37,870 --> 00:49:39,230
It's too late.

784
00:49:40,090 --> 00:49:41,710
Running out of time.

785
00:49:54,560 --> 00:49:55,240
Naruto!

786
00:49:55,560 --> 00:49:56,560
Are you alright?

787
00:49:57,480 --> 00:49:58,480
Naruto!

788
00:50:14,430 --> 00:50:15,430
What do you want?

789
00:50:16,985 --> 00:50:18,250
It's a lovely night.

790
00:50:20,680 --> 00:50:22,010
You wanna quench your thirst?

791
00:50:32,535 --> 00:50:36,200
Unless I'm wrong, the week you gave Naruto
is up tomorrow, isn't it?

792
00:50:42,750 --> 00:50:43,750
I wonder where he is.

793
00:50:44,270 --> 00:50:45,350
I haven't seen him in days.

794
00:50:48,660 --> 00:50:49,660
Beats me.

795
00:50:55,585 --> 00:50:57,460
I think I'll have something to eat.

796
00:50:57,785 --> 00:50:59,200
Bring me the special, will ya?

797
00:50:59,450 --> 00:51:00,450
Coming right up.

798
00:51:10,020 --> 00:51:11,220
Let's go home.

799
00:51:11,680 --> 00:51:13,400
... All right, Orochimaru.

800
00:51:16,200 --> 00:51:19,440
Oh, very well, I'll go get you some food.

801
00:51:19,755 --> 00:51:20,600
I'll be back in a minute.

802
00:51:20,601 --> 00:51:20,760
...

803
00:51:20,960 --> 00:51:21,980
A small shop.

804
00:51:23,040 --> 00:51:24,580
Uh-oh.

805
00:51:25,100 --> 00:51:29,940
I'll get you some food.

806
00:51:29,941 --> 00:51:31,800
I'll get you some food.

807
00:51:31,801 --> 00:51:32,801
...

808
00:51:45,540 --> 00:51:46,820
Lady Tsunade!

809
00:51:50,110 --> 00:51:51,110
How is he doing?

810
00:51:52,430 --> 00:51:53,670
He's collapsed from exhaustion.

811
00:51:55,100 --> 00:51:58,400
And his right hand is severely burned from
concentrated chakra.

812
00:52:00,080 --> 00:52:00,720
He's out of it.

813
00:52:00,721 --> 00:52:04,140
He won't wake up till the day after
tomorrow at the earliest.

814
00:52:07,570 --> 00:52:09,160
Old Jiraiya was right about me.

815
00:52:10,750 --> 00:52:13,240
To think I've sunk so low, I'd bet against
a kid.

816
00:52:15,300 --> 00:52:15,820
Ha!

817
00:52:16,180 --> 00:52:18,240
What am I getting so torn up about?

818
00:52:19,160 --> 00:52:20,680
It's his problem, not mine.

819
00:52:26,060 --> 00:52:27,060
And tomorrow?

820
00:52:29,730 --> 00:52:31,420
Please tell me you're not going tomorrow!

821
00:52:35,945 --> 00:52:36,960
Why don't you answer?

822
00:52:37,185 --> 00:52:38,185
Say something!

823
00:52:39,025 --> 00:52:40,560
Lady Tsunade, answer me!

824
00:52:40,680 --> 00:52:41,780
I need to know!

825
00:52:44,180 --> 00:52:46,920
Because if you tell me you're going...

826
00:52:47,924 --> 00:52:48,960
What then?

827
00:52:50,050 --> 00:52:53,120
I will try and stop you, if it costs me my
life!

828
00:52:56,520 --> 00:52:57,520
Shizune!

829
00:52:58,020 --> 00:53:00,060
Have you forgotten who you're talking to?

830
00:53:07,900 --> 00:53:24,690
Yes, I have.

831
00:53:24,691 --> 00:53:27,610
It's important that nothing interferes
with these negotiations.

832
00:53:28,790 --> 00:53:29,890
Your point being?

833
00:53:31,030 --> 00:53:33,250
Tsunade's companion could be trouble.

834
00:53:33,670 --> 00:53:35,890
I'd feel better if she were dead.

835
00:53:44,870 --> 00:53:45,870
Hey!

836
00:53:46,180 --> 00:53:47,270
Where the heck am I?

837
00:53:53,150 --> 00:53:54,150
Naruto, I...

838
00:53:55,450 --> 00:53:55,930
Naruto!

839
00:53:55,931 --> 00:53:57,150
What time is it?

840
00:53:57,330 --> 00:53:58,430
What day is it today?

841
00:53:58,650 --> 00:53:59,310
What day?

842
00:53:59,350 --> 00:54:00,350
What time?

843
00:54:00,440 --> 00:54:01,750
It's Monday morning.

844
00:54:04,530 --> 00:54:05,010
Why?

845
00:54:05,310 --> 00:54:06,310
What is it?

846
00:54:06,850 --> 00:54:07,610
It's amazing.

847
00:54:07,730 --> 00:54:09,530
Are you sure you're feeling all right?

848
00:54:10,570 --> 00:54:13,230
You were supposed to be out of it for two
full days at least.

849
00:54:14,770 --> 00:54:15,770
Not a chance.

850
00:54:16,160 --> 00:54:19,910
No matter how beat up I get, just give me
a good night's sleep and I'll be fine.

851
00:54:19,911 --> 00:54:21,690
And I'm right back at the top of my game.

852
00:54:22,390 --> 00:54:24,870
Of course, the nine-tailed fox.

853
00:54:25,770 --> 00:54:29,030
Besides, I've got a date to keep with that
rotten old witch Tsunade.

854
00:54:29,900 --> 00:54:32,510
Today's the day I wipe that smirk off her
face.

855
00:54:32,810 --> 00:54:34,690
So, you've mastered the jutsu?

856
00:54:35,905 --> 00:54:38,710
Uh... no, not completely, but close
enough.

857
00:54:39,130 --> 00:54:40,150
So I'll just wing it.

858
00:54:40,170 --> 00:54:41,170
I'll be fine.

859
00:54:43,930 --> 00:54:45,310
What am I doing?

860
00:54:45,530 --> 00:54:46,870
We're running out of time.

861
00:54:47,455 --> 00:54:49,431
Hey, what... Stay here,
Naruto, you hear me?

862
00:54:49,530 --> 00:54:50,530
Stay here!

863
00:54:51,899 --> 00:54:53,370
What in the world?

864
00:54:53,530 --> 00:54:54,530
What is it?

865
00:54:54,790 --> 00:54:55,790
Huh?

866
00:54:57,750 --> 00:54:59,590
She slipped me a mickey.

867
00:55:02,144 --> 00:55:04,030
Double-crossing little vixen.

868
00:55:05,070 --> 00:55:07,430
She must have spiked my drink when I
wasn't looking.

869
00:55:08,540 --> 00:55:09,930
I can't build up any chakra.

870
00:55:11,130 --> 00:55:15,050
My body is so weak, I don't think I can
even throw a kunai straight.

871
00:55:16,470 --> 00:55:18,670
Straight enough to nearly kill me.

872
00:55:19,610 --> 00:55:20,970
Great, pervy sage!

873
00:55:21,590 --> 00:55:24,470
And you're always going on about what a
great ninja you are!

874
00:55:24,765 --> 00:55:26,790
What, did you get distracted by her pretty
face?

875
00:55:27,170 --> 00:55:28,170
Shut up!

876
00:55:30,010 --> 00:55:32,810
She possesses a healer's knowledge of
herbs and elixirs.

877
00:55:33,940 --> 00:55:35,070
I should have known better.

878
00:55:35,660 --> 00:55:39,630
Only Tsunade could whip up a knockout drug
that even a ninja couldn't detect.

879
00:55:41,370 --> 00:55:44,350
But still, to be caught off guard like
that...

880
00:55:45,000 --> 00:55:46,550
I must be losing my touch.

881
00:55:50,210 --> 00:55:53,090
I wasn't expecting to find Jiraiya,
the mountain sage.

882
00:55:54,450 --> 00:55:55,810
That's more than I bargained for.

883
00:55:57,125 --> 00:55:58,510
I may have to rethink this.

884
00:56:01,390 --> 00:56:05,090
And Naruto... to think you'd be here too.

885
00:56:07,210 --> 00:56:12,920
Okay, Shizune.

886
00:56:13,180 --> 00:56:13,740
Yes?

887
00:56:13,920 --> 00:56:14,920
What is it?

888
00:56:15,640 --> 00:56:18,800
It's time you told us about your mistress
and Orochimaru.

889
00:56:19,480 --> 00:56:21,140
What kind of deal are they making?

890
00:56:21,879 --> 00:56:22,879
Orochimaru?

891
00:56:28,240 --> 00:56:30,920
I never imagined she would go through with
it.

892
00:56:32,040 --> 00:56:35,260
That's why I... I didn't say anything
about it before.

893
00:56:36,600 --> 00:56:37,680
But now...

894
00:56:39,680 --> 00:56:40,980
There's no time to lose!

895
00:56:41,220 --> 00:56:42,740
You must come with me quickly!

896
00:56:42,741 --> 00:56:44,780
I'll explain on the way!

897
00:56:45,040 --> 00:56:46,040
Let's go then.

898
00:56:46,160 --> 00:56:46,980
Don't forget me!

899
00:56:47,160 --> 00:56:48,160
I'm coming too!

900
00:57:09,120 --> 00:57:10,820
Well, what's your answer?

901
00:57:11,980 --> 00:57:13,460
You can't be serious!

902
00:57:15,040 --> 00:57:16,720
The answer has to be no!

903
00:57:16,721 --> 00:57:17,880
No, at least it better be!

904
00:57:18,440 --> 00:57:21,520
So, things are worse than I thought.

905
00:57:22,920 --> 00:57:26,540
Could it be that the loss of those two has
clouded her judgement?

906
00:57:31,400 --> 00:57:33,720
You give me no choice, Tsunade.

907
00:57:33,800 --> 00:57:35,980
If I have to kill you, I will.

908
00:57:41,080 --> 00:57:42,080
I

909
00:57:51,750 --> 00:57:53,310
will heal your arms.

910
00:57:53,770 --> 00:57:58,170
But in exchange, you keep your hands off
the village.

911
00:58:00,330 --> 00:58:02,670
Very well...

912
00:58:26,860 --> 00:58:28,260
Time...

913
00:58:39,330 --> 00:58:42,890
Shall we...

914
00:58:58,870 --> 00:59:03,290
As soon as his arms are healed, Orochimaru
is planning to destroy the Leaf Village!

915
00:59:03,850 --> 00:59:05,890
Of course, that's just what I'd expect.

916
00:59:06,150 --> 00:59:09,830
And trust me, he'll do far more than that
if we don't manage to stop him somehow.

917
00:59:09,831 --> 00:59:12,690
Who does this creep think he is?!

918
00:59:16,490 --> 00:59:17,850
That's what you're for.

919
00:59:18,870 --> 00:59:20,530
No need to worry.

920
00:59:56,600 --> 00:59:57,600
...

921
01:00:06,480 --> 01:00:08,980
So that's your answer, Tsunade.

922
01:00:09,180 --> 01:00:11,200
After all I've offered you.

923
01:00:12,600 --> 01:00:15,620
You would repay me by trying to kill me?

924
01:00:17,740 --> 01:00:20,820
Fortunately, I can depend on Kabuto's
loyalty.

925
01:00:21,320 --> 01:00:24,434
A good thing he arrived
in time to see the evil

926
01:00:24,435 --> 01:00:28,061
intent hidden in those
healing hands of yours.

927
01:00:28,160 --> 01:00:28,580
Yes.

928
01:00:29,020 --> 01:00:31,060
She and I are from the Medical Corps.

929
01:00:31,061 --> 01:00:34,480
Before, I could tell she was building up
her chakra for an attack.

930
01:00:37,820 --> 01:00:38,940
Tsunade, Tsunade.

931
01:00:39,340 --> 01:00:43,120
And I was going to restore your loved ones
to you.

932
01:00:44,200 --> 01:00:48,020
I even agreed to give up my dream of
destroying the Leaf Village.

933
01:00:54,110 --> 01:00:57,350
I knew your promise to leave the village
alone was worthless.

934
01:00:57,630 --> 01:00:58,630
A lie.

935
01:01:00,290 --> 01:01:04,870
But even so... even though I knew that...

936
01:01:07,210 --> 01:01:10,630
I only wish this feeling would go away,
but I know it never will.

937
01:01:16,250 --> 01:01:18,450
It seems we've reached an impasse.

938
01:01:18,710 --> 01:01:19,850
So be it.

939
01:01:20,110 --> 01:01:23,770
I'm afraid you give me no choice but to
use force.

940
01:01:45,440 --> 01:01:46,940
Come on, Orochimaru!

941
01:01:49,900 --> 01:01:54,981
It's amazing that in all this time, you
and I have never actually met in combat.

942
01:01:58,520 --> 01:01:59,520
That's right.

943
01:01:59,660 --> 01:02:00,940
Don't get your hopes up.

944
01:02:01,120 --> 01:02:02,680
You still have to go through me.

945
01:02:03,040 --> 01:02:04,040
No matter.

946
01:02:04,080 --> 01:02:05,940
It'll be a pleasure killing you both.

947
01:02:06,120 --> 01:02:07,120
Right now!

948
01:02:08,860 --> 01:02:11,360
She hasn't lost any of her strength.

949
01:02:11,600 --> 01:02:13,040
It won't go well for you at all.

950
01:02:13,060 --> 01:02:14,256
I don't know if she ever connects.

951
01:02:14,280 --> 01:02:15,540
I can see that.

952
01:02:18,980 --> 01:02:21,400
This is not the battlefield I would have
chosen.

953
01:02:21,660 --> 01:02:22,720
It's too cramped here.

954
01:02:22,940 --> 01:02:24,160
A change of scenery.

955
01:02:24,480 --> 01:02:25,000
Yes.

956
01:02:25,220 --> 01:02:26,680
I think a change would be wise.

957
01:02:27,260 --> 01:02:31,740
When I found her attendant, she was with
someone who might prove troublesome to us.

958
01:02:32,520 --> 01:02:34,180
They could be here any minute.

959
01:02:40,020 --> 01:02:43,240
This troublesome
someone... Who is it?

960
01:02:43,360 --> 01:02:44,620
One of the Sanyans.

961
01:02:44,621 --> 01:02:45,621
Same as you.

962
01:02:46,380 --> 01:02:47,380
Jiraiya.

963
01:02:55,180 --> 01:02:56,700
No, you don't.

964
01:02:56,701 --> 01:02:58,400
I'm going to finish this.

965
01:03:03,450 --> 01:03:04,450
Whoa.

966
01:03:04,730 --> 01:03:06,170
What the heck happened here?

967
01:03:07,940 --> 01:03:08,940
Well, well.

968
01:03:10,110 --> 01:03:12,470
I'd say something put Tsunade in a bad
mood.

969
01:03:12,471 --> 01:03:14,270
She's got a foul temper.

970
01:03:15,310 --> 01:03:18,370
So, this must mean she refused him.

971
01:03:19,010 --> 01:03:20,010
Well, okay.

972
01:03:20,290 --> 01:03:22,670
But where's the grumpy old bat now?

973
01:03:25,330 --> 01:03:26,330
Hm?

974
01:03:28,250 --> 01:03:29,530
Her jacket.

975
01:03:33,100 --> 01:03:34,100
Which way?

976
01:03:34,330 --> 01:03:35,330
Well, Tonton?

977
01:03:36,870 --> 01:03:38,190
Okay, let's go!

978
01:03:50,524 --> 01:03:52,180
Out of breath already?

979
01:03:53,190 --> 01:03:56,220
Well, none of us are getting any younger,
are we?

980
01:03:56,940 --> 01:03:58,420
Time to end it.

981
01:04:01,540 --> 01:04:04,680
Taijutsu was never my forte, but...

982
01:04:10,030 --> 01:04:11,030
A food pill.

983
01:04:14,730 --> 01:04:17,310
So he knows medical ninjutsu, too.

984
01:04:42,140 --> 01:04:43,020
And I'll give it to you.

985
01:04:43,021 --> 01:04:44,021
My arm...

986
01:04:45,380 --> 01:04:46,160
And I'll give it to you.

987
01:04:46,161 --> 01:04:46,420
Tonton.

988
01:04:46,460 --> 01:04:47,460
I'll give it to you.

989
01:04:49,540 --> 01:04:49,980
Take that!

990
01:04:49,981 --> 01:04:50,120
Oof.

991
01:04:50,121 --> 01:04:50,320
A few more times.

992
01:04:50,380 --> 01:04:50,500
This is a RFID.

993
01:04:50,501 --> 01:04:51,556
You have a night vision, yet you don't
have any brain.

994
01:04:51,580 --> 01:04:53,160
Also, yourchaot is only in your brain.

995
01:04:54,020 --> 01:04:54,460
Agh!

996
01:04:54,860 --> 01:04:55,480
Looks like you've got something in your
brain.

997
01:04:55,481 --> 01:04:58,320
W-what is she thinking?

998
01:04:58,321 --> 01:04:59,540
That's true.

999
01:04:59,700 --> 01:05:02,427
With this scalpel, I
could sever an artery or

1000
01:05:02,428 --> 01:05:05,321
puncture your heart without
even breaking the skin.

1001
01:05:05,820 --> 01:05:10,960
But of course, that requires careful aim
and a long blade, both of which are

1002
01:05:10,961 --> 01:05:12,940
difficult to accomplish in the heat of
battle.

1003
01:05:13,360 --> 01:05:14,540
But that's it!

1004
01:05:22,200 --> 01:05:22,760
Damn!

1005
01:05:23,140 --> 01:05:24,980
He hit my intercostals!

1006
01:05:25,280 --> 01:05:26,260
Can't breathe!

1007
01:05:26,261 --> 01:05:29,560
This kid's no ordinary medical ninja.

1008
01:05:30,380 --> 01:05:35,020
I was never that quick or precise,
even in my prime.

1009
01:05:36,700 --> 01:05:40,000
Have to be careful to avoid hitting
anything too vital.

1010
01:05:40,140 --> 01:05:42,100
We don't want you dying just yet.

1011
01:05:42,440 --> 01:05:45,520
Still, you're not going to be moving much
anytime soon.

1012
01:05:59,860 --> 01:06:01,260
I underestimated her.

1013
01:06:01,940 --> 01:06:07,180
She shouldn't still be conscious,
let alone... All right, then.

1014
01:06:08,190 --> 01:06:10,100
I guess I'll have to stop going easy on
her.

1015
01:06:16,590 --> 01:06:23,190
I try to move my right arm... and my left
leg tenses...

1016
01:06:25,370 --> 01:06:25,930
No!

1017
01:06:25,931 --> 01:06:27,090
She couldn't have!

1018
01:06:27,230 --> 01:06:27,610
No!

1019
01:06:27,610 --> 01:06:27,610
She couldn't have!

1020
01:06:27,630 --> 01:06:28,630
...

1021
01:06:30,210 --> 01:06:31,210
Surprise!

1022
01:06:36,910 --> 01:06:38,770
I can only hope it worked.

1023
01:06:39,170 --> 01:06:41,210
Because that was about all I've got.

1024
01:06:48,890 --> 01:06:50,050
Now I see.

1025
01:06:52,490 --> 01:06:53,890
Nothing's responding right.

1026
01:06:54,290 --> 01:06:55,810
But it's not my muscles.

1027
01:06:57,950 --> 01:07:00,610
I see you've finally figured it out.

1028
01:07:00,910 --> 01:07:03,390
It's your whole nervous system.

1029
01:07:04,390 --> 01:07:08,215
I turned my chakra
into electricity, then sent

1030
01:07:08,216 --> 01:07:11,450
an electrical charge
ripping through your body!

1031
01:07:11,930 --> 01:07:18,030
She attacked his lines of communication,
scrambling the electrical impulses that

1032
01:07:18,031 --> 01:07:21,550
carry messages from the brain to the
different parts of the body.

1033
01:07:21,650 --> 01:07:23,210
Cut off from the brain.

1034
01:07:23,330 --> 01:07:25,250
His body doesn't know what to do.

1035
01:07:25,251 --> 01:07:27,910
She's literally short-circuited him.

1036
01:07:29,390 --> 01:07:35,330
To be capable of this in her condition...
But then, she is one of the Sanin.

1037
01:07:38,630 --> 01:07:41,210
Don't have enough chakra for a healing
jutsu.

1038
01:07:41,550 --> 01:07:43,130
But I have to do what I can.

1039
01:07:49,630 --> 01:07:52,090
When I try to move my right hand...

1040
01:07:53,530 --> 01:07:55,210
My left leg responds.

1041
01:07:56,770 --> 01:07:59,410
And trying to move my left ankle...

1042
01:08:00,690 --> 01:08:02,670
Moves my right shoulder.

1043
01:08:09,950 --> 01:08:10,950
It's tricky.

1044
01:08:11,590 --> 01:08:13,050
But I think...

1045
01:08:13,850 --> 01:08:14,850
Yes.

1046
01:08:15,270 --> 01:08:18,510
I think I've just about figured out what
moves what.

1047
01:08:19,470 --> 01:08:21,410
Thought you had me, didn't you?

1048
01:08:22,729 --> 01:08:23,729
Surprise.

1049
01:08:26,390 --> 01:08:27,390
Now then!

1050
01:08:28,149 --> 01:08:28,670
Impossible!

1051
01:08:29,090 --> 01:08:30,970
He could never have recovered so quickly!

1052
01:08:31,270 --> 01:08:33,270
Soon, you fear the sight of blood,
eh?

1053
01:08:34,350 --> 01:08:36,310
Let's put it to the test, shall we?

1054
01:08:47,930 --> 01:08:48,930
Jiraiya?

1055
01:08:49,689 --> 01:08:51,170
It's been a long time.

1056
01:08:51,171 --> 01:08:52,590
My old friend.

1057
01:08:55,069 --> 01:08:56,529
Long time indeed.

1058
01:08:56,970 --> 01:08:59,270
And I can't say it's improved your looks
any.

1059
01:08:59,370 --> 01:09:00,370
Old friend.

1060
01:09:05,870 --> 01:09:06,870
Hey!

1061
01:09:07,830 --> 01:09:08,830
Kabuto!

1062
01:09:11,050 --> 01:09:12,050
Naruto.

1063
01:09:15,990 --> 01:09:18,149
You've met this guy before, Naruto?

1064
01:09:18,729 --> 01:09:20,090
Well, of course I have.

1065
01:09:20,210 --> 01:09:21,950
We took the Chunin exams together.

1066
01:09:22,649 --> 01:09:24,529
What are you doing here, Kabuto?

1067
01:09:26,930 --> 01:09:27,950
Get out of the way!

1068
01:09:30,210 --> 01:09:31,430
Stay out of this!

1069
01:09:31,649 --> 01:09:32,649
I can handle them!

1070
01:09:35,930 --> 01:09:37,529
So you recovered quickly!

1071
01:09:37,810 --> 01:09:38,810
No matter!

1072
01:09:41,529 --> 01:09:43,590
You're still not at a hundred percent!

1073
01:09:46,130 --> 01:09:47,770
The game's up, kid!

1074
01:09:48,609 --> 01:09:49,609
Too late for that!

1075
01:09:50,710 --> 01:09:52,010
Too late for that!

1076
01:09:54,130 --> 01:09:54,730
Too late for that!

1077
01:09:54,731 --> 01:09:55,731
Too late for that!

1078
01:09:57,650 --> 01:09:59,010
Your jutsu's worn off!

1079
01:09:59,215 --> 01:10:00,530
Now I am at a hundred percent!

1080
01:10:03,090 --> 01:10:04,090
Blood...

1081
01:10:05,450 --> 01:10:08,006
I knew that I'd never
be able to take on two

1082
01:10:08,007 --> 01:10:10,630
of the legendary
Sannin at the same time.

1083
01:10:10,910 --> 01:10:13,910
But now at least...
I got one down!

1084
01:10:15,530 --> 01:10:16,530
Lady Tsunade!

1085
01:10:18,010 --> 01:10:19,210
I don't get it!

1086
01:10:19,230 --> 01:10:20,230
What's going on?

1087
01:10:20,510 --> 01:10:21,510
I'm confused!

1088
01:10:21,590 --> 01:10:22,810
Did I miss out on something?

1089
01:10:22,811 --> 01:10:25,950
How come Kabuto and Grandma Tsunade are
mixing it up?

1090
01:10:26,350 --> 01:10:29,550
I see you're as slow as ever, Naruto.

1091
01:10:31,910 --> 01:10:34,510
No wonder you're no match for Sasuke.

1092
01:10:37,170 --> 01:10:40,530
If you want your answer, just look at his
headband.

1093
01:10:40,830 --> 01:10:42,550
It serves Orochimaru.

1094
01:10:45,690 --> 01:10:46,690
That's right.

1095
01:10:47,190 --> 01:10:49,890
I'm a spy from the village hidden in the
sound.

1096
01:10:53,690 --> 01:10:57,010
But you... you helped us get through the
Chunin exams!

1097
01:10:57,350 --> 01:10:58,890
You saved our lives!

1098
01:10:59,350 --> 01:11:02,430
Only in order to gather information about
all of you.

1099
01:11:02,910 --> 01:11:04,410
That was my mission.

1100
01:11:05,810 --> 01:11:06,490
Indeed.

1101
01:11:06,491 --> 01:11:10,350
I learned one very important thing about
you, Naruto.

1102
01:11:12,390 --> 01:11:14,690
You lack any ninja ability.

1103
01:11:16,750 --> 01:11:18,950
You're not a bit like Sasuke.

1104
01:11:31,110 --> 01:11:31,670
You're a bit like me.

1105
01:11:31,671 --> 01:11:32,871
I've never seen her like this.

1106
01:11:33,350 --> 01:11:34,350
Never.

1107
01:11:39,800 --> 01:11:42,190
You don't have to do everything by
yourself, you know?

1108
01:11:44,680 --> 01:11:45,680
Let me help.

1109
01:11:46,020 --> 01:11:47,020
I'm here to serve you.

1110
01:11:49,180 --> 01:11:50,180
Grandma Tsunade!

1111
01:11:52,860 --> 01:11:54,710
Go on, glare at me all you want.

1112
01:11:54,890 --> 01:11:57,870
You're still just a pint-sized genin who's
in over his head.

1113
01:11:59,490 --> 01:12:03,290
I admit that the demon inside of you had
me worried for a time.

1114
01:12:03,530 --> 01:12:08,150
But surrounded by three of the legendary
Sanin, I see how insignificant you are.

1115
01:12:10,090 --> 01:12:13,910
Next to them, you're a mere child sitting
at the grown-up's table.

1116
01:12:14,150 --> 01:12:16,830
Stay out of it... or die.

1117
01:12:19,070 --> 01:12:20,130
Oh yeah!

1118
01:12:20,695 --> 01:12:22,190
Naruto, no!

1119
01:12:22,830 --> 01:12:24,750
My body's still shot!

1120
01:12:25,730 --> 01:12:27,070
His right hand!

1121
01:12:27,310 --> 01:12:28,490
I think it's hurt!

1122
01:12:31,670 --> 01:12:33,150
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

1123
01:12:33,970 --> 01:12:35,790
I'll hit him with multiple attacks!

1124
01:12:36,210 --> 01:12:39,770
And come at him from the right side,
where his defenses are weak!

1125
01:12:44,630 --> 01:12:45,630
Dirty!

1126
01:12:47,470 --> 01:12:48,470
Ah!

1127
01:13:03,490 --> 01:13:05,210
Toys and needles!

1128
01:13:11,950 --> 01:13:14,230
Thanks, Shizune.

1129
01:13:19,450 --> 01:13:20,450
Plasma pill!

1130
01:13:21,369 --> 01:13:22,490
Plasma pill?

1131
01:13:27,350 --> 01:13:28,370
Well, of course.

1132
01:13:28,490 --> 01:13:31,190
He's trying to replace the blood that he's
already lost.

1133
01:13:31,670 --> 01:13:35,010
We can't have too much blood, can we,
Kabuto?

1134
01:13:35,870 --> 01:13:40,010
Lord Orochimaru, isn't it time to take the
bandage off your arm?

1135
01:13:50,490 --> 01:13:52,470
So that's Orochimaru!

1136
01:13:53,370 --> 01:13:55,090
You take four eyes.

1137
01:13:55,210 --> 01:13:56,210
Okay, Shizune?

1138
01:13:56,330 --> 01:13:59,270
I can handle our friend, Orochimaru!

1139
01:14:02,130 --> 01:14:03,590
There's just one thing.

1140
01:14:03,850 --> 01:14:08,110
I need Tsunade to do something about my
body before we get started here.

1141
01:14:08,111 --> 01:14:12,130
It may be a while before the full effects
of that drug completely leave your system.

1142
01:14:12,270 --> 01:14:14,930
I'm very sorry, but it can't be helped,
Master Jiraiya.

1143
01:14:15,090 --> 01:14:15,310
What?

1144
01:14:15,510 --> 01:14:16,510
You've got to be kidding!

1145
01:14:17,210 --> 01:14:19,250
Ah, well, what can you do, right?

1146
01:14:19,990 --> 01:14:21,970
I'll just have to face him as I am.

1147
01:14:23,910 --> 01:14:26,850
Tsunade, use your recovery ninjutsu and
rest.

1148
01:14:27,390 --> 01:14:28,310
What about me?

1149
01:14:28,410 --> 01:14:29,410
What should I do?

1150
01:14:29,510 --> 01:14:30,510
Don't do anything.

1151
01:14:30,790 --> 01:14:33,890
You just stand guard over Tsunade with the
pig, okay?

1152
01:14:34,130 --> 01:14:34,370
Fine.

1153
01:14:34,510 --> 01:14:35,390
Come on!

1154
01:14:35,391 --> 01:14:36,810
I want to fight this guy!

1155
01:14:36,811 --> 01:14:38,490
He's gotta pay for what he did!

1156
01:14:38,510 --> 01:14:39,510
Forget about it!

1157
01:14:40,210 --> 01:14:41,930
That jerk with the glasses is right.

1158
01:14:42,380 --> 01:14:43,690
You're in over your head.

1159
01:14:44,730 --> 01:14:49,610
Our opponent's one of the Sannin like me,
and the man who killed the third Hokage.

1160
01:14:50,210 --> 01:14:51,850
This is an eye for an eye!

1161
01:14:52,510 --> 01:14:55,110
I'm the only one who can fight Orochimaru!

1162
01:14:55,810 --> 01:15:00,150
And four eyes over there could go
toe-to-toe with Kakashi if he had to.

1163
01:15:02,350 --> 01:15:05,510
Now then, how about we get this thing
started?

1164
01:15:16,620 --> 01:15:17,200
Let's do it!

1165
01:15:17,201 --> 01:15:18,000
Summoning Jutsu!

1166
01:15:18,040 --> 01:15:19,040
Summoning Jutsu!

1167
01:15:29,340 --> 01:15:30,340
What's up?

1168
01:15:31,020 --> 01:15:31,700
What's up?

1169
01:15:31,920 --> 01:15:33,160
Why are you here?

1170
01:15:33,260 --> 01:15:34,620
Where the hell's your father?

1171
01:15:35,000 --> 01:15:35,360
Hey, hey!

1172
01:15:35,560 --> 01:15:36,700
Long time no see!

1173
01:15:38,360 --> 01:15:39,520
Well, Jiraiya.

1174
01:15:39,521 --> 01:15:41,620
Still playing the fool, I see.

1175
01:15:42,350 --> 01:15:46,580
You always were ridiculous, but this time
you've outdone yourself.

1176
01:15:48,000 --> 01:15:50,540
Clearly, our Tsunade has gotten to you
somehow.

1177
01:15:51,360 --> 01:15:52,440
Well, how do you like that?

1178
01:15:52,540 --> 01:15:54,220
He's already spotted my weakness.

1179
01:15:57,440 --> 01:16:00,600
You're as big a disgrace as the day we
met.

1180
01:16:01,540 --> 01:16:02,300
That's it!

1181
01:16:02,440 --> 01:16:05,640
I'm not gonna let that guy stand there and
mock Pervy Sage!

1182
01:16:08,260 --> 01:16:09,460
Summoning Jutsu!

1183
01:16:11,840 --> 01:16:15,080
That's the Ninetales brat from the Junin
Exam.

1184
01:16:16,260 --> 01:16:19,560
I suppose I should have killed him when I
had the opportunity.

1185
01:16:20,260 --> 01:16:25,140
For the sake of the Akatsuki and their
goals, I let the boy slip by.

1186
01:16:25,780 --> 01:16:29,394
But the only ones ever capable
of breaking a five-pronged

1187
01:16:29,395 --> 01:16:33,300
seal were the Third Hokage
and we of the legendary Sani.

1188
01:16:33,480 --> 01:16:34,220
That may be.

1189
01:16:34,221 --> 01:16:36,920
But Jiraiya is training the boy.

1190
01:16:37,920 --> 01:16:39,320
You could be right.

1191
01:16:39,760 --> 01:16:43,560
If he's learned to wield the power of the
Ninetales, it's not impossible.

1192
01:16:48,780 --> 01:16:50,900
But that doesn't appear to be the case.

1193
01:16:52,720 --> 01:16:55,680
He never had any skill as a shinobi to
begin with.

1194
01:16:58,020 --> 01:16:59,880
He's still got a long way to go.

1195
01:17:01,000 --> 01:17:02,900
Where the heck did I go wrong?

1196
01:17:02,901 --> 01:17:04,200
Hi, everybody!

1197
01:17:04,560 --> 01:17:06,460
Hey, friend, how are ya?

1198
01:17:07,105 --> 01:17:08,120
Hey, Gamatatsu!

1199
01:17:08,760 --> 01:17:09,820
Why did you pop out?

1200
01:17:09,860 --> 01:17:10,860
Where's the old man?

1201
01:17:12,040 --> 01:17:14,240
Oh... Gamakichi, what's going on?

1202
01:17:14,560 --> 01:17:17,640
This is the first time anyone's ever
summoned me.

1203
01:17:17,975 --> 01:17:20,080
I'm finally getting a chance to shine.

1204
01:17:20,540 --> 01:17:21,540
You dummy!

1205
01:17:21,665 --> 01:17:24,120
Get some munchies and go find a place to
hide, will ya?

1206
01:17:24,830 --> 01:17:26,460
Wait, they got snacks here?

1207
01:17:26,960 --> 01:17:28,780
Gee whiz, this is the coolest.

1208
01:17:29,580 --> 01:17:30,580
Let's begin.

1209
01:17:33,180 --> 01:17:35,480
I want you to leave Jiraiya to me.

1210
01:17:35,820 --> 01:17:38,760
The rest are yours to play with,
as you will.

1211
01:18:00,560 --> 01:18:01,560
Naruto!

1212
01:18:03,480 --> 01:18:06,040
You're dealing with me, old friend.

1213
01:18:10,100 --> 01:18:11,180
No problem.

1214
01:18:11,300 --> 01:18:12,540
Earth-style Dark Swamp!

1215
01:18:22,420 --> 01:18:23,500
Ah, great.

1216
01:18:23,920 --> 01:18:25,960
This bog is way too small.

1217
01:18:26,080 --> 01:18:27,860
It's not deep enough to sink him.

1218
01:18:28,380 --> 01:18:30,300
The drug hasn't run its course yet.

1219
01:18:31,560 --> 01:18:33,340
It's not a total loss, though.

1220
01:18:33,380 --> 01:18:35,540
These snakes aren't going anywhere in this
state.

1221
01:18:36,880 --> 01:18:38,000
Ninja art!

1222
01:18:38,200 --> 01:18:39,300
Poison frog!

1223
01:18:41,040 --> 01:18:43,220
One breath of this and I'm a dead man!

1224
01:18:48,680 --> 01:18:50,320
My leg tendons!

1225
01:18:54,280 --> 01:18:57,440
I'll not let you eat me a second time!

1226
01:18:58,500 --> 01:18:59,500
I want to fight him!

1227
01:19:02,500 --> 01:19:03,500
Ah!

1228
01:19:19,880 --> 01:19:21,400
Ninja Art!

1229
01:19:21,860 --> 01:19:23,180
Needle Jizo!

1230
01:19:28,320 --> 01:19:29,320
Blast!

1231
01:19:29,321 --> 01:19:31,480
The jutsu isn't strong enough.

1232
01:19:32,400 --> 01:19:36,320
Even if we are both impaired, you haven't
a chance of beating me.

1233
01:19:36,560 --> 01:19:38,520
You might as well give up already.

1234
01:20:12,280 --> 01:20:13,880
What a tragedy.

1235
01:20:14,120 --> 01:20:17,500
I had only the utmost respect for you as a
fellow medical ninja.

1236
01:20:18,360 --> 01:20:18,940
Stay back!

1237
01:20:19,160 --> 01:20:20,300
Get away from me!

1238
01:20:20,920 --> 01:20:23,520
Please, get a hold of yourself,
Lady Tsunade.

1239
01:20:23,980 --> 01:20:29,540
Else the name of Sanya, of which Lord
Orochimaru is counted, weep for shame.

1240
01:20:33,760 --> 01:20:35,440
I can't move!

1241
01:20:35,800 --> 01:20:37,400
My body's too heavy!

1242
01:20:38,380 --> 01:20:39,480
Look at you.

1243
01:20:39,760 --> 01:20:43,457
They used to call you the
town madman, and now you're

1244
01:20:43,458 --> 01:20:47,540
plodding along dutifully for
the village with this rat in tow.

1245
01:20:47,820 --> 01:20:50,100
You've really fallen off, haven't you?

1246
01:20:50,740 --> 01:20:55,120
Trust me, I've always had a good eye for
talent.

1247
01:20:55,940 --> 01:21:01,860
With that one, all I see is insipid
mediocrity.

1248
01:21:03,240 --> 01:21:05,340
You hit the nail on the head.

1249
01:21:06,540 --> 01:21:09,020
What would I want with the Uchiha kid?

1250
01:21:09,380 --> 01:21:14,540
Tell me, where's the fun in teaching a boy
who's already a genius to begin with?

1251
01:21:15,960 --> 01:21:17,040
How touching.

1252
01:21:17,220 --> 01:21:20,960
You're drawn to him because he reminds you
of your old self, is that it?

1253
01:21:20,961 --> 01:21:24,824
That brat of yours could
never beat Uchiha, born

1254
01:21:24,825 --> 01:21:27,980
as he was into the
shinobi art of Sharingan.

1255
01:21:28,540 --> 01:21:33,420
Without Sharingan, poor Naruto hasn't a
chance of surpassing him.

1256
01:21:33,920 --> 01:21:37,510
A shinobi's strength
rests upon his ability to

1257
01:21:37,511 --> 01:21:40,881
obtain and master all
the jutsu of this world.

1258
01:21:40,980 --> 01:21:44,005
The very reason we are
called ninja is because

1259
01:21:44,006 --> 01:21:47,541
of the many ninjutsu
arts that we wield.

1260
01:21:48,080 --> 01:21:49,080
Hmph.

1261
01:21:49,980 --> 01:21:50,980
You're wrong.

1262
01:21:51,400 --> 01:21:53,260
That's not what makes a shinobi.

1263
01:21:54,780 --> 01:21:56,620
You never did get it.

1264
01:21:57,500 --> 01:22:02,560
A real ninja is one who endures no matter
what gets thrown at him.

1265
01:22:03,480 --> 01:22:05,820
A difference of opinion, I suppose.

1266
01:22:07,355 --> 01:22:09,700
Let me explain something to you.

1267
01:22:11,200 --> 01:22:14,040
There's only one thing that matters if
you're a shinobi.

1268
01:22:15,700 --> 01:22:17,960
And it isn't the number of jutsu you
possess.

1269
01:22:19,430 --> 01:22:20,500
All you do need...

1270
01:22:22,380 --> 01:22:23,780
Is the guts.

1271
01:22:24,350 --> 01:22:25,620
You'll never give up!

1272
01:22:31,420 --> 01:22:36,680
That's enough already, you traitor!

1273
01:22:42,280 --> 01:22:43,280
HAAAAAA!

1274
01:22:47,720 --> 01:22:48,720
HAAAAAAA!

1275
01:22:58,980 --> 01:22:59,980
Hmm.

1276
01:23:00,590 --> 01:23:03,270
I don't know what jutsu
you learned, but you'll need

1277
01:23:03,271 --> 01:23:05,700
to be more subtle than
that if you want to hit me.

1278
01:23:08,160 --> 01:23:09,160
It's no use.

1279
01:23:09,765 --> 01:23:11,720
I'm not going to be able to hit a moving
target.

1280
01:23:16,280 --> 01:23:17,280
Darn it.

1281
01:23:19,290 --> 01:23:21,880
And I still can't hold in all the chakra
yet.

1282
01:23:23,700 --> 01:23:26,055
It looks like you've fractured
the thigh bone in the

1283
01:23:26,056 --> 01:23:28,640
left leg during your little
tussle with the serpent.

1284
01:23:29,900 --> 01:23:32,400
If it were only the bone, you could still
move.

1285
01:23:33,000 --> 01:23:34,600
But it's beyond that now.

1286
01:23:35,080 --> 01:23:38,860
I've severed the lateral vastus muscle in
your right leg as well.

1287
01:23:41,040 --> 01:23:42,080
What do I do?

1288
01:23:42,480 --> 01:23:44,440
This jutsu takes two hands!

1289
01:23:44,700 --> 01:23:47,200
If it gets even one of my arms,
it's over!

1290
01:23:51,140 --> 01:23:52,140
What's the matter?

1291
01:23:52,300 --> 01:23:53,420
Are you frightened?

1292
01:23:53,700 --> 01:23:56,160
Hope you don't feel like running away.

1293
01:23:58,560 --> 01:24:03,680
Naruto, as I remember you were nothing but
big talk during that first Chunin exam.

1294
01:24:04,820 --> 01:24:06,480
Don't underestimate me.

1295
01:24:06,640 --> 01:24:07,960
I don't run away.

1296
01:24:08,400 --> 01:24:11,520
I don't care if I'm a genie the rest of my
life.

1297
01:24:12,260 --> 01:24:14,580
You guys aren't going to scare me off.

1298
01:24:14,820 --> 01:24:16,880
I'll still be Hokage someday.

1299
01:24:19,020 --> 01:24:21,500
So, where's all your big talk now?

1300
01:24:21,880 --> 01:24:22,880
Heh.

1301
01:24:23,700 --> 01:24:26,060
It's because unlike you, that's my goal.

1302
01:24:26,460 --> 01:24:27,460
Just watch.

1303
01:24:27,640 --> 01:24:29,260
Someday I'll be Hokage!

1304
01:24:32,540 --> 01:24:34,000
To be Hokage!

1305
01:24:34,200 --> 01:24:35,200
That's my dream!

1306
01:24:38,780 --> 01:24:40,280
You're not a kid anymore.

1307
01:24:40,600 --> 01:24:42,960
You don't want to shoot your mouth off
like that.

1308
01:24:43,580 --> 01:24:45,460
Admit when you're in over your head.

1309
01:24:45,740 --> 01:24:47,800
Sometimes it's better to run away.

1310
01:24:53,790 --> 01:24:55,670
Come now, what's the matter?

1311
01:24:55,830 --> 01:24:57,090
Why such a look?

1312
01:24:57,850 --> 01:25:00,910
If I kill you, you can kiss your dreams
goodbye.

1313
01:25:03,230 --> 01:25:06,070
You're always so reckless, you want to
kill yourself?

1314
01:25:06,410 --> 01:25:08,338
You're still just a
genie, so if ever there's

1315
01:25:08,339 --> 01:25:11,311
a real battle you
get out of there fast.

1316
01:25:11,870 --> 01:25:13,030
Are you crazy?

1317
01:25:13,290 --> 01:25:14,670
I'm never gonna run away!

1318
01:25:16,670 --> 01:25:17,670
град.Upooo!

1319
01:25:39,670 --> 01:25:42,310
Little kids think life is so easy.

1320
01:25:43,710 --> 01:25:46,850
That's why they're always going on and on
about their dreams.

1321
01:25:47,810 --> 01:25:49,690
That's why they never give up.

1322
01:25:51,250 --> 01:25:52,930
Jiraiya, what were you thinking?

1323
01:25:53,270 --> 01:25:55,490
You went and taught this kid the Rasengan?

1324
01:25:56,230 --> 01:25:59,490
What's the point of teaching it to someone
who can never master it?

1325
01:25:59,491 --> 01:26:02,490
Giving him false hopes like that.

1326
01:26:02,550 --> 01:26:04,650
Filling his head with stupid ideas.

1327
01:26:05,050 --> 01:26:08,370
Making him think he could actually be
Hokage someday.

1328
01:26:14,550 --> 01:26:18,810
They go chasing after some stupid dream
and they die.

1329
01:26:28,490 --> 01:26:29,490
That's enough!

1330
01:26:31,770 --> 01:26:33,530
I'm not gonna run away!

1331
01:26:33,970 --> 01:26:36,130
I never go back on my word!

1332
01:26:38,610 --> 01:26:39,930
That's my nindo!

1333
01:26:40,530 --> 01:26:41,990
My ninja way!

1334
01:26:47,690 --> 01:26:48,790
You should've died.

1335
01:26:48,791 --> 01:26:50,471
You should have stayed out of this,
Naruto.

1336
01:27:03,730 --> 01:27:04,730
What are you doing?

1337
01:27:20,790 --> 01:27:21,790
Grandma.

1338
01:27:24,770 --> 01:27:26,530
Still haven't had enough.

1339
01:27:31,100 --> 01:27:33,080
Get ready to pay up on our bet.

1340
01:27:34,340 --> 01:27:36,640
The cursed necklace of yours is about to
be mine!

1341
01:27:40,380 --> 01:27:42,040
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

1342
01:27:43,840 --> 01:27:45,800
Shadow clones can't help him here.

1343
01:27:47,500 --> 01:27:48,060
Enough!

1344
01:27:48,440 --> 01:27:50,560
Naruto, you don't have to protect me!

1345
01:27:50,720 --> 01:27:51,720
Stop already!

1346
01:27:53,960 --> 01:27:56,080
I warned you not to be stubborn.

1347
01:27:56,440 --> 01:27:57,560
Now you die!

1348
01:27:57,920 --> 01:27:59,560
You've just thrown it all away!

1349
01:27:59,900 --> 01:28:01,920
Dreams don't come true when you're dead!

1350
01:28:02,120 --> 01:28:03,420
Just get out of the way, Naruto!

1351
01:28:03,880 --> 01:28:04,160
No!

1352
01:28:04,340 --> 01:28:05,340
Look out!

1353
01:28:07,960 --> 01:28:09,460
Don't you worry about me!

1354
01:28:18,520 --> 01:28:23,860
Until I become Hokage, I don't care what
happens, I am not gonna die!

1355
01:28:24,420 --> 01:28:27,380
Okay, let's see you dodge me this time!

1356
01:28:27,580 --> 01:28:28,580
Here goes!

1357
01:28:37,140 --> 01:28:39,820
AAAAAAAAAAAAAA SEISON!

1358
01:28:43,200 --> 01:28:44,520
What's this?

1359
01:28:45,460 --> 01:28:49,620
unicorn AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

1360
01:29:32,720 --> 01:29:40,720
ha well well the kid actually did it A
child mastering a jutsu like that.

1361
01:29:40,721 --> 01:29:42,120
It's unheard of.

1362
01:29:43,300 --> 01:29:44,580
It's... impossible.

1363
01:29:45,140 --> 01:29:46,560
But he did it.

1364
01:30:13,800 --> 01:30:15,280
And you.

1365
01:30:15,860 --> 01:30:17,400
How can you be standing after that?

1366
01:30:20,220 --> 01:30:22,820
I focused my chakra at the point of
impact.

1367
01:30:23,160 --> 01:30:25,900
Before he'd even hit me, I'd started
healing myself.

1368
01:30:26,480 --> 01:30:30,440
You see now why Lord Orochimaru values me
so highly.

1369
01:30:30,800 --> 01:30:33,341
Not only for my skills
and knowledge of jutsu,

1370
01:30:33,342 --> 01:30:36,661
but most of all for my
recuperative powers.

1371
01:30:37,644 --> 01:30:43,761
No matter how great the injury, I can
repair and re-energize any damaged cells.

1372
01:30:44,060 --> 01:30:45,620
But there is a limit.

1373
01:30:46,000 --> 01:30:47,380
And I'm almost out of time.

1374
01:30:47,400 --> 01:30:48,400
I have enough chakra.

1375
01:30:49,660 --> 01:30:52,620
Naruto, on the other hand, doesn't have
that gift.

1376
01:30:52,900 --> 01:30:54,140
He looks finished.

1377
01:31:04,240 --> 01:31:10,600
I never thought... even with my healing
powers... the damage was too great.

1378
01:31:13,415 --> 01:31:16,980
And now... I haven't enough chakra left.

1379
01:31:24,400 --> 01:31:25,920
His heart is failing.

1380
01:31:31,330 --> 01:31:34,410
The muscles surrounding his heart have
been torn to shreds.

1381
01:31:34,550 --> 01:31:36,610
How the heck did it happen and when?

1382
01:31:37,230 --> 01:31:38,230
Wait, of course!

1383
01:31:40,470 --> 01:31:44,890
That moment just before they separated...
Kabuto must have struck at his heart!

1384
01:31:51,340 --> 01:31:52,460
Stop shaking!

1385
01:31:52,740 --> 01:31:53,740
Get a grip!

1386
01:32:00,805 --> 01:32:01,880
You're wasting your time!

1387
01:32:02,525 --> 01:32:03,640
It's all over for him!

1388
01:32:04,425 --> 01:32:09,580
With my last strength... I severed his
heart's chakra network!

1389
01:32:10,470 --> 01:32:18,120
I cut him off... from getting any help...
from the... demon... the nine-tailed fox!

1390
01:32:19,804 --> 01:32:24,420
And he hasn't the power... to save
himself!

1391
01:32:26,640 --> 01:32:28,220
I'm telling you, he's finished.

1392
01:32:28,600 --> 01:32:29,600
Dead.

1393
01:32:30,555 --> 01:32:32,460
All your skills are useless now.

1394
01:32:32,600 --> 01:32:33,600
Oh, shut up!

1395
01:32:34,570 --> 01:32:37,040
You'll be dead soon, I'll see to that!

1396
01:32:43,870 --> 01:32:45,290
He stopped breathing!

1397
01:32:48,410 --> 01:32:51,030
No... no... no!

1398
01:33:01,550 --> 01:33:05,750
Dark... it's getting dark...

1399
01:33:06,830 --> 01:33:12,230
The light is fading... my strength...
fading...

1400
01:33:12,890 --> 01:33:13,890
Why?

1401
01:33:25,200 --> 01:33:34,120
No... don't die... don't
die... don't die... Don't die!

1402
01:33:34,900 --> 01:33:37,725
I told you.

1403
01:33:43,565 --> 01:33:45,120
.. I'd win...

1404
01:33:48,160 --> 01:33:50,100
He's... still alive?

1405
01:34:01,140 --> 01:34:07,140
To be Hokage... that's still your dream,
Naruto... isn't it?

1406
01:34:07,380 --> 01:34:09,460
... ...

1407
01:34:10,580 --> 01:34:11,580
...

1408
01:34:14,990 --> 01:34:15,990
...

1409
01:34:17,950 --> 01:34:19,490
One more time...

1410
01:34:21,790 --> 01:34:23,750
Just one more time...

1411
01:34:24,550 --> 01:34:26,430
For the last time...

1412
01:34:28,630 --> 01:34:31,830
I want those words to be true...

1413
01:34:35,530 --> 01:34:38,990
There's far more to this little genie than
meets the eye.

1414
01:34:39,210 --> 01:34:43,410
There's no telling what might happen if
the Akatsuki get their hands on him.

1415
01:34:43,670 --> 01:34:46,750
But if you were
to die... Right now!

1416
01:34:54,870 --> 01:34:56,650
WHAT THE DEVIL?!

1417
01:35:06,570 --> 01:35:08,050
He's coming for the boy!

1418
01:35:09,430 --> 01:35:10,791
1... 2...

1419
01:35:13,350 --> 01:35:16,431
3... 4... 5...

1420
01:35:24,170 --> 01:35:27,830
Tsunade, you are the one person I wouldn't
want to kill.

1421
01:35:28,505 --> 01:35:29,510
Listen to me.

1422
01:35:29,750 --> 01:35:33,062
If that brat is allowed
to live, it will mean more

1423
01:35:33,063 --> 01:35:35,890
trouble than you and your
friends could ever imagine.

1424
01:35:36,550 --> 01:35:38,010
Stay out of my way.

1425
01:35:38,011 --> 01:35:39,011
No.

1426
01:35:39,490 --> 01:35:41,010
You listen to me.

1427
01:35:41,660 --> 01:35:45,810
If I do nothing else, I will protect this
boy!

1428
01:35:48,150 --> 01:35:50,330
And how do you plan to do that?

1429
01:35:50,490 --> 01:35:53,910
Look at you, your body is shivering like a
leaf in the wind.

1430
01:35:54,710 --> 01:36:00,010
Besides, why would you, one of the Sanin,
risk your life to save a lowly Genin?

1431
01:36:11,620 --> 01:36:12,620
By saving him.

1432
01:36:12,740 --> 01:36:15,380
I'm saving... my home.

1433
01:36:16,160 --> 01:36:17,600
The village hidden in the leaves.

1434
01:36:22,120 --> 01:36:24,780
You really think you're protecting the
village?

1435
01:36:35,320 --> 01:36:40,186
You see, this boy,
this lowly little Genin,

1436
01:36:40,187 --> 01:36:44,121
has been chosen by fate
to be Hokage someday.

1437
01:36:46,800 --> 01:36:48,220
What nonsense.

1438
01:36:48,860 --> 01:36:51,400
Even if it is true, what of it?

1439
01:36:51,520 --> 01:36:53,820
Who cares about the Hokage?

1440
01:36:54,520 --> 01:36:56,820
Only a fool would want that job.

1441
01:36:58,460 --> 01:37:00,220
Playing at Hokage.

1442
01:37:00,500 --> 01:37:02,260
It's just a fool's game.

1443
01:37:08,680 --> 01:37:10,620
Think of my uncle and your brother.

1444
01:37:11,740 --> 01:37:13,480
It'd be a betrayal of them.

1445
01:37:13,800 --> 01:37:15,280
A betrayal of yourself.

1446
01:37:16,280 --> 01:37:19,080
Have you forgotten all your dreams?

1447
01:37:24,240 --> 01:37:27,042
Remember the Hokage
that have come before and

1448
01:37:27,043 --> 01:37:29,520
all they've accomplished
for the Leaf Village.

1449
01:37:29,800 --> 01:37:34,660
They were willing to gamble everything,
even their lives, to make sure the village

1450
01:37:34,661 --> 01:37:37,200
survived and prospered through troubled
times.

1451
01:37:41,200 --> 01:37:42,780
I won't let her do it!

1452
01:37:42,820 --> 01:37:45,060
She can't sit there and make fun of the
old man!

1453
01:37:45,400 --> 01:37:47,160
I don't care if she is a lady!

1454
01:37:47,480 --> 01:37:49,600
I'll knock that sneer off her face!

1455
01:37:56,840 --> 01:38:01,640
From now on, I'm gambling everything too.

1456
01:38:03,120 --> 01:38:05,200
I'm putting my life on the line!

1457
01:38:07,360 --> 01:38:11,400
Well, if you're really willing to throw
your life away for the sake of one

1458
01:38:11,401 --> 01:38:14,880
insignificant brat, I'm happy to
accommodate you!

1459
01:38:31,620 --> 01:38:35,420
Now all that's left is Naruto himself.

1460
01:38:35,421 --> 01:38:37,220
Lady Tsunade!

1461
01:38:49,840 --> 01:38:54,220
She's torn to ribbons, and she can still
move that quickly!

1462
01:38:57,480 --> 01:38:58,240
Hmm.

1463
01:38:58,241 --> 01:39:00,760
You really are determined, aren't you?

1464
01:39:00,840 --> 01:39:01,500
I'm impressed.

1465
01:39:01,501 --> 01:39:01,860
Hmm.

1466
01:39:01,860 --> 01:39:01,860
You really are determined, aren't you?

1467
01:39:01,860 --> 01:39:02,860
I'm impressed.

1468
01:39:05,300 --> 01:39:07,440
Didn't I make it clear enough,
you fool?

1469
01:39:07,920 --> 01:39:09,740
I meant what I said!

1470
01:39:10,080 --> 01:39:12,600
I will die before I let you touch him!

1471
01:39:14,460 --> 01:39:16,220
You're half dead already!

1472
01:39:19,140 --> 01:39:20,140
Such brave choices, Toku.

1473
01:39:41,900 --> 01:39:49,900
A little pause... and we are back.

1474
01:40:27,020 --> 01:40:27,180
A little pause... and we are back.

1475
01:40:28,020 --> 01:40:29,700
But that mark...

1476
01:40:31,380 --> 01:40:32,100
No!

1477
01:40:32,380 --> 01:40:33,680
Ladies, you know they wait!

1478
01:40:33,980 --> 01:40:35,480
Let me treat your wounds!

1479
01:40:35,660 --> 01:40:37,620
Please, don't break the seal!

1480
01:40:40,800 --> 01:40:42,440
Reserve seal release!

1481
01:40:43,920 --> 01:40:46,600
Ninja Art, Mitotic Regeneration!

1482
01:40:57,750 --> 01:40:59,690
What jutsu is this?

1483
01:41:01,270 --> 01:41:02,350
Let's see!

1484
01:41:04,790 --> 01:41:09,910
It seems I'm not the only person who's been
spending their time discovering new jutsu.

1485
01:41:10,150 --> 01:41:11,890
This one's very impressive.

1486
01:41:12,410 --> 01:41:13,410
How's it done?

1487
01:41:13,750 --> 01:41:14,750
My chakra!

1488
01:41:15,890 --> 01:41:19,750
For years I've stored it up in a space
behind my forehead.

1489
01:41:20,790 --> 01:41:22,930
Saving it for just such an occasion.

1490
01:41:23,070 --> 01:41:28,651
With this chakra reservoir, my body's
ability to create new cells is accelerated.

1491
01:41:28,790 --> 01:41:32,473
The cells divide rapidly,
spreading throughout

1492
01:41:32,474 --> 01:41:35,631
my body and regenerating
any damaged organs.

1493
01:41:36,470 --> 01:41:39,350
It's like having the ability to
reincarnate myself.

1494
01:41:39,810 --> 01:41:44,270
You see, you can slash away at me all you
want, but I can't be killed.

1495
01:41:46,610 --> 01:41:49,861
What she doesn't say is that
a person, any person, even

1496
01:41:49,862 --> 01:41:53,110
her, can only generate new
cells a limited number of times.

1497
01:41:53,210 --> 01:41:55,870
If you speed that up, you shorten your
life!

1498
01:41:57,470 --> 01:42:02,880
No, that can only mean...

1499
01:42:03,540 --> 01:42:04,620
Lord Orochimaru!

1500
01:42:06,800 --> 01:42:08,420
Quickly, come out!

1501
01:42:08,480 --> 01:42:09,480
Come out!

1502
01:42:10,540 --> 01:42:11,640
Do it!

1503
01:42:11,660 --> 01:42:12,660
Hurry!

1504
01:42:13,040 --> 01:42:14,920
Ino Inu Saratori Hitsuchi!

1505
01:42:17,920 --> 01:42:19,000
Shamanin Jutsu!

1506
01:42:24,520 --> 01:42:44,540
How you doing, Daddy?

1507
01:42:44,541 --> 01:42:45,541
Hmm?

1508
01:42:53,270 --> 01:42:54,820
Oh, he's looking at us!

1509
01:42:54,920 --> 01:42:55,540
Watch out!

1510
01:42:55,800 --> 01:42:56,980
Yo, Gamatatsu!

1511
01:42:57,200 --> 01:42:58,440
Time to skedaddle!

1512
01:42:58,620 --> 01:42:59,120
Say what?

1513
01:42:59,540 --> 01:43:01,000
But it's just getting exciting!

1514
01:43:01,460 --> 01:43:02,580
Shut up and get moving!

1515
01:43:05,740 --> 01:43:06,400
Shamanin Jutsu!

1516
01:43:06,401 --> 01:43:07,480
Shamanin Jutsu!

1517
01:43:08,680 --> 01:43:09,940
Shamanin Jutsu!

1518
01:43:10,120 --> 01:43:10,740
Shamanin Jutsu!

1519
01:43:10,741 --> 01:43:11,780
Shamanin Jutsu!

1520
01:43:13,240 --> 01:43:14,520
Shamanin Jutsu!

1521
01:43:14,521 --> 01:43:15,100
Orochimaru!

1522
01:43:15,520 --> 01:43:16,980
Katsuyu and Tsunade!

1523
01:43:17,680 --> 01:43:20,740
The dear old faces reunited once again!

1524
01:43:25,760 --> 01:43:28,020
Did you bring a hanky, Jiraiya?

1525
01:43:28,180 --> 01:43:29,740
I think I'm going to cry.

1526
01:43:30,200 --> 01:43:31,240
You old fool.

1527
01:43:31,560 --> 01:43:35,640
I didn't summon you here after all of this
time just to listen to your stupid jokes.

1528
01:43:36,679 --> 01:43:39,000
This rivalry's gone on long enough.

1529
01:43:39,220 --> 01:43:40,660
It's time to end it.

1530
01:43:40,661 --> 01:43:45,000
Today, I'm putting Orochimaru out of our
misery once and for all.

1531
01:43:48,180 --> 01:43:51,260
Well, Orochimaru, why have you dragged me
here?

1532
01:43:51,600 --> 01:43:54,420
You know I don't like being summoned.

1533
01:43:59,260 --> 01:44:02,420
Maybe I should just eat you and be done
with it.

1534
01:44:02,600 --> 01:44:04,680
No, please don't talk that way,
Lord Manda.

1535
01:44:04,840 --> 01:44:07,260
You'll be well rewarded for your trouble,
don't worry.

1536
01:44:07,261 --> 01:44:09,620
Who do you think you're talking to,
you little bug?

1537
01:44:09,621 --> 01:44:13,260
What would the likes of you have that I
could possibly want?

1538
01:44:18,560 --> 01:44:23,960
So, Orochimaru, when this is over,
I'll expect a hundred human sacrifices.

1539
01:44:27,880 --> 01:44:31,243
If Manda finds out that
his master can't use any

1540
01:44:31,244 --> 01:44:34,220
of his jutsu, he's more
than likely to betray us.

1541
01:44:34,900 --> 01:44:36,080
This was a mistake.

1542
01:44:36,600 --> 01:44:39,600
No matter how hopeless things looked,
he never should have summoned us.

1543
01:44:39,620 --> 01:44:41,220
And Manda, not in his condition.

1544
01:44:42,500 --> 01:44:44,180
Katsuyu, see to the boy.

1545
01:44:44,440 --> 01:44:45,940
Take him to Shizune quickly.

1546
01:44:46,520 --> 01:44:48,380
Yes, my lady, at once.

1547
01:44:59,330 --> 01:44:59,910
There.

1548
01:45:00,250 --> 01:45:01,250
I'm ready.

1549
01:45:05,190 --> 01:45:07,250
Shizune, please look after the boy.

1550
01:45:09,370 --> 01:45:10,370
Naruto...

1551
01:45:11,125 --> 01:45:13,790
The battle to come promises to be a most
fearful one.

1552
01:45:14,250 --> 01:45:17,830
You and this clone of myself must take the
boy somewhere safe.

1553
01:45:18,240 --> 01:45:20,310
And see that no harm comes to him.

1554
01:45:22,525 --> 01:45:26,470
This is the wish of your mistress,
Lady Tsunade.

1555
01:45:28,580 --> 01:45:30,550
Hm-hm-hm-hm-hm...

1556
01:45:42,180 --> 01:45:43,180
Heh-heh-heh!

1557
01:45:44,210 --> 01:45:48,130
I'm going to pop you like a balloon,
you stinkin' dirty toad!

1558
01:45:48,530 --> 01:45:50,450
Then please come on and try it.

1559
01:45:50,490 --> 01:45:52,750
I've always wanted a snakeskin wallet.

1560
01:45:57,790 --> 01:46:00,810
Orochimaru, you're no longer fit to be one
of us.

1561
01:46:01,680 --> 01:46:03,750
Your evil days are finally at an end.

1562
01:46:04,320 --> 01:46:05,320
One of us?

1563
01:46:07,120 --> 01:46:08,790
What an insult.

1564
01:46:08,930 --> 01:46:11,690
After this, there'll be one less Sannin in
the world.

1565
01:46:29,460 --> 01:46:30,700
Acid slime!

1566
01:46:37,780 --> 01:46:39,640
I'll start with you!

1567
01:46:41,120 --> 01:46:45,460
Now, Katsuyo!

1568
01:46:45,580 --> 01:46:46,580
Yes, my lady.

1569
01:47:05,440 --> 01:47:06,440
They're coming!

1570
01:47:06,580 --> 01:47:07,960
I can see them!

1571
01:47:17,760 --> 01:47:19,060
Tsunade, keep back!

1572
01:47:19,840 --> 01:47:21,780
Time for some oil, buta!

1573
01:47:22,300 --> 01:47:23,760
You got it!

1574
01:47:27,740 --> 01:47:28,500
That's it!

1575
01:47:28,501 --> 01:47:28,920
Fire style!

1576
01:47:29,300 --> 01:47:30,460
Toad-blade bomb!

1577
01:47:45,600 --> 01:47:45,980
Hmph!

1578
01:47:46,000 --> 01:47:47,300
That did it!

1579
01:47:47,600 --> 01:47:48,640
You think?

1580
01:47:52,920 --> 01:47:53,920
No.

1581
01:47:53,960 --> 01:47:54,960
Too easy.

1582
01:48:00,340 --> 01:48:01,620
Of course.

1583
01:48:01,860 --> 01:48:03,340
He just shed his skin.

1584
01:48:05,000 --> 01:48:05,600
Buta!

1585
01:48:05,720 --> 01:48:06,720
Look out below!

1586
01:48:06,940 --> 01:48:08,220
Yeah, I feel it!

1587
01:48:11,180 --> 01:48:12,180
Damn!

1588
01:48:12,240 --> 01:48:13,240
Huh?

1589
01:48:17,500 --> 01:48:21,200
There, take that!

1590
01:48:23,700 --> 01:48:26,140
Fighting one Sani would be hard enough.

1591
01:48:26,340 --> 01:48:27,740
But two...

1592
01:48:31,700 --> 01:48:34,340
I've often wondered what it would be like
to ring the bell.

1593
01:48:34,360 --> 01:48:35,700
In that pretty neck of yours.

1594
01:48:39,100 --> 01:48:41,240
I can't give in!

1595
01:48:41,900 --> 01:48:44,540
I have to give it everything I've got!

1596
01:48:47,760 --> 01:48:48,760
Impossible!

1597
01:49:01,180 --> 01:49:02,180
Insane strength!

1598
01:49:03,000 --> 01:49:04,500
And he took the full brunt of it.

1599
01:49:06,730 --> 01:49:07,730
It's over.

1600
01:49:08,780 --> 01:49:09,780
Yeah...

1601
01:49:14,250 --> 01:49:15,250
Lord Orochimaru!

1602
01:49:18,460 --> 01:49:20,780
He made me clumsy and careless!

1603
01:49:21,435 --> 01:49:24,550
I'd eat you both right now,
but I won't be swallowing

1604
01:49:24,551 --> 01:49:27,600
solid food for weeks thanks
to this hole in my mouth!

1605
01:49:28,595 --> 01:49:32,040
But if we meet again, well, he'd better
hope we don't!

1606
01:49:34,840 --> 01:49:35,840
...

1607
01:49:43,290 --> 01:49:48,390
Toonadie, so... you refuse to heal my
arms, do you?

1608
01:49:50,030 --> 01:49:51,450
Very well, then.

1609
01:49:55,920 --> 01:49:57,500
I don't need you.

1610
01:49:57,760 --> 01:49:59,720
There is one other way.

1611
01:50:05,100 --> 01:50:06,100
Huh?

1612
01:50:06,680 --> 01:50:10,040
And I will destroy the Leaf Village.

1613
01:50:13,000 --> 01:50:19,720
I hope we'll all meet again very soon when
I once more walk among you.

1614
01:50:21,780 --> 01:50:25,040
Until then, my dear old friends...

1615
01:50:25,920 --> 01:50:27,760
His face...

1616
01:50:29,700 --> 01:50:31,620
That explains it.

1617
01:50:31,640 --> 01:50:33,360
Someone else's body.

1618
01:50:33,820 --> 01:50:37,100
That explains the feeling I had as we
fought.

1619
01:50:37,240 --> 01:50:39,220
That he was different somehow.

1620
01:50:43,360 --> 01:50:49,122
When I return with the elixir of life,
I'll show you what it means to be...

1621
01:50:49,123 --> 01:50:50,601
truly immortal!

1622
01:50:52,380 --> 01:50:53,680
We'll meet again.

1623
01:50:58,780 --> 01:50:59,780
Wait!

1624
01:51:01,820 --> 01:51:05,400
With cracked ribs and a broken foot,
I'm useless.

1625
01:51:12,385 --> 01:51:15,200
The side effects of the jutsu are kicking
in.

1626
01:51:19,810 --> 01:51:21,380
Already my body is...

1627
01:51:47,294 --> 01:51:51,470
Tsunade, you never could recognize a
fool's bed when you saw it.

1628
01:51:58,220 --> 01:52:02,571
The jutsu's side effects...
Lady Tsunade... Huh?

1629
01:52:07,470 --> 01:52:08,550
I see.

1630
01:52:10,090 --> 01:52:11,090
It's all right.

1631
01:52:12,040 --> 01:52:14,610
If I rest a bit, my younger form will be
restored.

1632
01:52:15,715 --> 01:52:16,715
I'll go into town.

1633
01:52:17,290 --> 01:52:20,570
Then, when Naruto's recovered,
we can head back to the Leaf Village.

1634
01:52:21,790 --> 01:52:23,331
Tsunade... Heh.

1635
01:52:24,110 --> 01:52:25,150
No more first names.

1636
01:52:25,640 --> 01:52:27,240
You know what you've got to call me now.

1637
01:52:27,775 --> 01:52:28,775
What?!

1638
01:52:28,815 --> 01:52:30,450
The fifth Hokage?!

1639
01:52:31,910 --> 01:52:32,910
Unbelievable!

1640
01:52:33,850 --> 01:52:38,491
I'm out of it for a few minutes, and I
wake up to find out she's the Hokage!

1641
01:52:38,800 --> 01:52:41,150
Is, uh, something bothering you,
Naruto?

1642
01:52:41,570 --> 01:52:42,230
What's wrong?

1643
01:52:42,590 --> 01:52:43,390
Come on!

1644
01:52:43,450 --> 01:52:47,770
Shouldn't the Hokage be kind and wise and
everything, like the old man used to be?

1645
01:52:48,150 --> 01:52:50,950
And she's, well, mean and greedy!

1646
01:52:51,250 --> 01:52:52,930
And with a nasty temper!

1647
01:52:53,150 --> 01:52:55,010
And she's not all that smart!

1648
01:52:56,240 --> 01:53:00,490
Nothing personal or anything, but it's a
big job, and I'm not sure she's up to it.

1649
01:53:00,705 --> 01:53:04,730
Right, well... Lady Tsunade, are
you ready to order something?

1650
01:53:05,030 --> 01:53:09,810
On top of that, she's a 50-year-old lady
who uses jutsu to look like a young woman!

1651
01:53:10,030 --> 01:53:13,110
I just wonder if we really want a Hokage
like that!

1652
01:53:13,210 --> 01:53:15,650
You know, someone who's living a lie!

1653
01:53:15,950 --> 01:53:17,830
You want to take this outside,
kid!

1654
01:53:22,670 --> 01:53:23,870
Here we go.

1655
01:53:24,010 --> 01:53:26,450
It's deja vu all over again.

1656
01:53:36,270 --> 01:53:39,830
I may not be anyone's idea of perfect,
but I am Hokage now.

1657
01:53:40,250 --> 01:53:43,510
And even though I shouldn't dirty my hands
on a little squirt like you...

1658
01:53:46,040 --> 01:53:47,770
One finger's all I'm gonna need.

1659
01:53:48,130 --> 01:53:49,530
Not this time, Grandma!

1660
01:53:49,790 --> 01:53:51,350
And stop calling me squirt!

1661
01:53:51,470 --> 01:53:54,870
Right now I'm just a kid, but I'll be
Hokage myself one day!

1662
01:54:16,430 --> 01:54:19,930
Mine?ional No!

1663
01:54:20,600 --> 01:54:22,210
Not the forehead again!

1664
01:54:22,650 --> 01:54:23,650
P

1665
01:54:40,090 --> 01:54:48,090
школ生 You'll grow up to be a fine man.

1666
01:54:49,850 --> 01:54:52,550
And a great Hokage, too.

1667
01:54:58,160 --> 01:54:59,560
You bet!

1668
01:55:12,980 --> 01:55:14,980
Okay, let's go home, everyone.

1669
01:55:15,120 --> 01:55:16,420
To the Leaf Village!

1670
01:55:16,800 --> 01:55:17,360
Whoa!

1671
01:55:17,440 --> 01:55:18,440
Wait a second!

1672
01:55:18,500 --> 01:55:19,820
I haven't eaten yet!

1673
01:55:19,960 --> 01:55:20,960
Hey!

1674
01:55:21,580 --> 01:55:22,900
What's so funny?

1675
01:55:23,040 --> 01:55:24,120
I've been unconscious!

1676
01:55:24,660 --> 01:55:25,800
I'm starving!

1677
01:55:25,801 --> 01:55:26,801
Help me!

1678
01:55:44,020 --> 01:55:45,780
Do you see him, Nawaki?

1679
01:55:46,040 --> 01:55:47,040
Don?

1680
01:55:51,950 --> 01:55:54,110
Be at peace, my beloveds.

1681
01:55:54,111 --> 01:55:55,790
Your dream is still alive.

1682
01:55:58,350 --> 01:55:59,350
In him.

1683
01:56:43,540 --> 01:56:51,520
Your smile is the brightest of all.

1684
01:56:52,680 --> 01:57:00,260
Your dream is like a meteor, like a
rainbow after the rain.

1685
01:57:03,580 --> 01:57:05,840
It brings light to my heart.

1686
01:57:11,720 --> 01:57:18,820
To continue to wander is the only answer.

1687
01:57:21,000 --> 01:57:25,040
I swear I won't fool you.

